<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id" />
  <para style="h">NWOYO CIK</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk me abic pa Moses ma kilwongo Nwoyo Cik</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nwoyo Cik</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nwo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk me abic pa Moses ma kilwongo</para>
  <para style="mt1">NWOYO CIK</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man me Nwoyo Cik kicoyo kore kikore malubu kit lok ducu ma Moses oloko bot jo Icrael ikare ma onongo gin dong gitye i lobo Moab, kama onongo gugony iye inge wot mabor adada i aroo ma onongo gicok donyo i lobo Kanaan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok mogo ma pirgi tego i buk man gin ene: (1) Moses poyo wi dano pi jami madongo ma otime pi mwaka pyere angwen ma okato angec. Moses okok bot jo Icrael me po pi kit yo ma Lubanga otelogi kwede nia i aroo wek gubed jo ma luwiny ma gene bot Lubanga. (2) Moses onwoyo cik apar odoco kun tito telok me cik me acel kun lwongo dano me dyero kwogi bot Lubanga keken. Ka lacen en bene onwoyo tito lok ma mako cik mukeneni ducu me kwogi ka guo i lobo ca ma kiciko pire ni gin bio iyeni. (3) Moses bene opoyo wigi pi telok me gicike ma Lubanga ocike kwede botgi kun legogi me dyere kalubugi ducu. (4) Kiyero Yocwa me bedo latela pa jo pa Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lok mukwongo ma Moses oloko <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 1:1-4:49">1:1—4:49</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok me aryo ma Moses oloko <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 5:1-26:19">5:1—26:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Cik apar <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 5:1-10:22">5:1—10:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Cik mukene <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 11:1-26:19">11:1—26:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cik ma omyero kilub ka kibidonyo i lobo Kanaan <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 27:1-28:68">27:1—28:68</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Roco gicike <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 29:1-30:20">29:1—30:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok pa Moses me agiki <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 31:1-33:29">31:1—33:29</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">To pa Moses <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 34:1-12">34:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s1">Jami ma otime i Koreb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Man aye lok mayam Moses oloko bot jo Icrael ducu ki i loka Jordan i dye tim, i Araba ma okemo Cup, ikin Paran ki Topel, Laban, Kajerot ki Dijakab. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Nia ki i Koreb nio wa i Kadec Barnea tero kare maromo wot me nino apar wiye acel ki i yoo ma wok i lobo godi me Ceir. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />I mwaka me pyere angwene, inino dwe mukwongo me dwe me apar wiye acel, en aye Moses oloko iye ki jo Icrael ikom cik ducu ma Rwot yam omiye ma mako komgi. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 2:21-32">Wel 2:21-32</ref></char></note> Moses oloko kwedgi ikare ma dong otyeko loyo Cikon rwot pa jo Amor mayam bedo i Kecbon, ki Og rwot me Bacan mayam bedo i Acitarot ki i Edrei. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Moses omiine pi gonyo te cik man ki i loka Jordan, i lobo Moab. Magi aye gin ma en otito botgi ni, <verse eid="DEU 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“Rwot Lubangawa owaco botwa ki i Koreb ni, ‘Dong wubedo kare malac tutwal ite got man. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Dong wua woko wek wucak wot. Wucit i lobo godi pa jo Amor, ki bot jo ma gicok kwedgi ducu ma i Araba, bot jo ma i lobo godi ki i pwor got, ki i Negeb ki i lobo ma orabo dog Nam Mediterranean. Wucit i lobo Kanaan, ki i Lebanon nio wa i kulu madit, en Kulu Euprate. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Nen, dong atyeko keto lobonu inyimwu; wucit iye, wucam obed mewu, kit mayam Rwot okwongo bot kwarowu, bot Abraim, bot Icaka ki bot Yakobo, ni ebimiyo botgi ki bot likwayogi ma bilubugi.’”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moses oketo lungolkop</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Nia 18:13-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Moses owaco ki jo Icrael ni, “Ikare ma pud wan watye iwi got Cinai, an atitiwu ni, ‘Bedo latelawu obedo tic madit tutwal, ma an kena pe atwero timone. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Pien Rwot Lubangawu dong omiyo wun wunya mapol, ma omiyo tin nen, wun wupol macalo lwak lakalatwe me polo. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Dok bene myero Rwot Lubanga pa kwarowu dong omedwu wek wudok mapol tyen alip makato ma kombedi wutyeni, dok ominiwu gum, macalo yam ocikowu kwede! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Dok an kena abitwero tingo yec mapek kuman ningning me bedo kalaro lok ikinwu? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Piman wun ki komwu wuyer jo ma luryeko, jo makwiri muteggi, muporo wel kakawu ducu, ci abiketogi wek gubed lutela maloyo wiwu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Ci wun yam wudoka iye ni, ‘Lok ma iloko botwani ber, myero watii.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Pimeno akwanyo ludito wi kakawu, jo maryek, muteggi, ci aketogi gubedo lutela wi jo alip, ki lutela wi jo miya, ki lutela wi jo pyere abic ki lutela wi jo apar, ki lutela mukene muporo kakawu ducu. <verse eid="DEU 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />Ikare meno aciko lungolkopwu ni, ‘Wuwiny pido ma ikin omegiwu ki lumegiwu, ci wungol kop atir ikin utmego ki ikin nyimego, nyo ki larok mo ma bedo bote. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Ka wungolo kop, pe wudwor kor dano mo; wuwiny lok pa dano matidi marom ki pa dano madit. Pe wulwor wang dano mo, pien ngolo kop tye bot Lubanga. Ka lok mo tek loyowu, ci wukel bota, ci an biwinyone.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Ikare ca yam acikowu ikom gin ducu ma myero wutim.”<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kicwalo lurotpiny ki i Kadec Barnea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Wel 13:1-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />“Yam wacako wot kit ma Rwot Lubangawa ocikowa kwede. Wa a woko ki i Koreb, ci wacito wabaro dye tim meno ducu malac ki malik mayam wuneno, i yoo ma kemo lobo godi pa jo Amor; ci wabino wa i Kadec Barnea. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Ci awaciwu ni, ‘Wun dong wuo i lobo godi pa jo Amor en, ma Rwot Lubangawa bimiyowa. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Nen, Rwot Lubangawu oketo lobonu inyimwu; wucit wucam obed mewu, macalo Rwot Lubanga pa kwarowu yam ocikowu; pe wulwor, cwinywu pe bene ocid woko.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />Ci wun ducu wubino cok bota, kun wuwaco ni, ‘Wek wacwal dano i nyimwa wek gurot lobo, ka gudwok lok botwa ikom yoo ma myero wawok ki iye, ki ikom taun madongo ma wabio iye.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />Ci an yam aneno ni loke ber, ci akwanyo jo apar wiye aryo ki ikinwu, dano acel ki i kaka acel acel. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Ci gin gua, gucito i lobo godi, ka guo i nota me Ecikol, ci guroto ducu. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Ci gukwanyo nyig yadi mogo ma ocek i lobonu, gumako ki cinggi, ci guo kwede wa botwa, dok gudwoko lok botwa bene kun giwaco ni lobo ma Rwot Lubangawa tye kamiyo ki wan ber dok ceko cam.<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 9:23">Nwo 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:16">Ibru 3:16</ref></char>
    </note>Ento wun yam onongo pe wumito cito kunu. Ci wun wujemo woko ikom cik pa Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Wubedo ka nguru i kemawu, kun wuwaco ni, ‘Pien Rwot yam dagwa en aye gin ma omiyo okwanyowa woko ki i lobo Ejipt, owek omiyowa i cing jo Amor, me tyekowa woko liweng. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Wan wabicito kunu pi gin ango ka? Utmegiwa ma gucito kunu karoto piny gumiyo cwinywa ongabe angaba ma guwaco ki wan ni, jo maca gidongo dok giboco gikatowa woko; gitye ki taun madito, dok gugoyo cel matego ma o wa i pol; dok bene waneno likwayo pa jo Anak kunu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />Ci an dok awaco botwu ni, ‘Pe atiba opot ikomwu, pe wulworgi. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Rwot Lubangawu matye katelo nyimwuni, en aye bene bilweny pirwu, marom kit mayam wuneno ki wangwu gin ma en otimo pirwu i Ejipt <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:18">Tic 13:18</ref></char></note>wa ki i dye tim bene. Wun ki komwu yam wuneno kit ma Rwot Lubangawu okelowu kwede, kun timo kumeno i yo ducu ma wuwoto iye nio ka wuo kwede ikabedo man, macalo dano ma otingo latine.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:19">Ibru 3:19</ref></char></note>Ento kadi bed aloko kumeno, wun wukwero geno Rwot Lubangawu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />mayam obedo katelo kiwun yo wek eyeny kabedo ma wubiguru iye kemawu. Dyewor en woto i wir mac ki dyeceng woto i wir pol pi nyutuwu yo ma wucito iye.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga opwodo jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 14:20-45">Wel 14:20-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 3:18">Ibru 3:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka yam Rwot owinyo lok ma wuloko ducu, ci kiniga omake, omiyo okwongo kwong ni, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />‘Pe tye ngat mo ma ikin yalwak man maraci ma bio i lobo maber mayam akwongo pire ni abimiyo bot kwarowu, <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />kono Kaleb wod pa Jepune keken. En aye bio iye, dok abimiyo bote ki bot lutinone lobo mayam en onyono ki tyene, pien en obedo kalubu gin ma Rwot mito ducu kakare.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Kiniga yam omako Rwot wa ikom an bene pirwu, ci owaco bota ni, ‘In bene pe ibio i lobo kunu. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Ento Yocwa wod pa Nun ma tiyo botini, en aye bicito iye. Cuk cwinye, pien en aye dong bimiyo jo Icrael gileyo lobo ca. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />Dok lutinowu ma wun wuwaconi kibiyakogi wokoni, lutinowu ma kombedi peya gingeyo gin maber ki maraci, gin aye gibicito iye; dok abimiyone botgi, ci gibicamo, dok bibedo meggi. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Ento wun giwu wuloke, wucak wot me dok cen i dye tim yo tung Nam Makwar.’<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiloyo jo Icrael i Korma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 14:39-45">Wel 14:39-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />Ci wun dok wugamo doga kun wuwaco ni, ‘Wan dong wabalo inyim Rwot; wabicito kalweny kit macalo Rwot Lubangawa ocikowa. Dano acel acel ikinwu otwene ki jami lwenye, kun wutamo ni bedo yot me cito i lobo godi. <verse eid="DEU 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />Ci Rwot owaco bota ni wac botgi ni pe wucit kunu, dok pe wulweny, pien an pe atye i dyewu, weko lumerokwu biloyowu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Yam aloko botwu, ci wukwero, pe wuwinyo; ento wujemo woko ikom cik pa Rwot, pien wuete, ci wuito malo wa i lobo godi. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Ci jo Amor ma gibedo i lobo godi kunu gubino ikomwu, ci guryemo korwu macalo kic, ci gudatowu woko piny i Ceir nio wa i Korma. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Ci wudwogo, wukok inyim Rwot; ento Rwot pe owinyo kokowu, pe ociko ite i lokwu. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Ma omiyo wubedo i Kadec kunu pi kare malac tutwal.”<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:4">Wel 21:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Lacen waloke, wawoto wacito i tim, i yoo ma dok tung Nam Makwar, kit macalo Rwot ocika; ci wabedo karabo nget lobo godi me Ceir pi kare malac. <verse eid="DEU 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />Ka dong Rwot owaco bota ni, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />‘Wun dong wutero kare ma oromo kun wurabo nget godi me lobo man; kombedi dong wuloke wudok tung kumalo.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:8">Aca 36:8</ref></char></note>Ci icik lwak kuman ni, ‘Wun dong wucok kawok ki i lobo pa utmegiwu likwayo pa Ecau ma gibedo i Ceir, ci gin bibedo ki lworo ikomwu. Ento wugwoke mada, <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />pe wucak lweny ikomgi, pien pe abimiyowu dul lobogi mo, pe kadi ma tyenwu romo cung iye, pien atyeko miyo lobo godi me Ceir bot Ecau obed mere. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Wubiwilo cam ki botgi wek wucam; dok bene wubiwilo pii amatawu ki botgi wek wumati.’<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />Pien Rwot Lubangawu obedo kanyayo gum ikom ticwu ducu ma wun wutiyo. En ngeyo gin ducu ma wuwok iye ikare ma wukato ki i twon dye tim man malac rwoki. Rwot Lubangawu obedo kwedwu i lwak mwaka pyere angweni ducu ma wubedo kawire i twon dye tim man labongo gin mo murem botwu. <verse eid="DEU 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />Ci waa woko ki i kanget utmegiwa likwayo pa Ecau ma gibedo i Ceir, kun walubu yoo me Araba ma oa ki i Elat ki Ejion-geber. Ci waloke, wacito i yoo ma kemo tung tim me Moab. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:37">Aca 19:37</ref></char></note>Ka Rwot dok owaco bota ni, ‘Pe iket ayela mo ikom jo Moab, dok pe bene icak lweny ikomgi, pien pe abimiyi dul lobogi mo me bedo mewu, pien atyeko miyo Ar bot likwayo pa Lot me bedo meggi.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jo Emim ki rok mukene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />Yam onongo jo Emim aye gukwongo bedo i lobo kunu; gin rok madit, dok gipol bene, jo maboco macalo jo Anak. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Jo man kikwanogi ikin jo Repaim bene macalo jo Anak, ento jo Moab lwongogi ni jo Emim. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Ki jo Kori bene yam gukwongo bedo i Ceir, ento likwayo pa Ecau aye gucamo lobogi, ci gutyekogi woko liweng ki inyimgi, dok guleyo kabedogi, macalo jo Icrael gutimo ki lobo ma odoko meggi, ma Rwot omiyogini.<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />Ci dong wua wungolo nota ora me Jered kit ma Rwot ociko. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:28-35">Wel 14:28-35</ref></char></note>Nia ikare ma waa ki i Kadec Barnea nio ka wangolo nota ora me Jered onongo oromo mwaka pyere adek wiye aboro. Yalwak pa jo ma lulweny onongo dong guto gutum woko ki i gony, kit mayam Rwot okwongo kwede kwong ikomgi. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Ada cing Rwot onongo tye ikomgi liking nio ka otyekogi woko ducu ki i gony.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />“Kitmeno ka yam jo ducu ma lulweny guto gutum woko ki ikin lwak, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />ci Rwot owaco bota ni, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />‘Tin dong ibikato ki iwang lobo Moab kun iwok ki i Ar. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:38">Aca 19:38</ref></char></note>Ka dong i nyiko cok inyim likwayo pa Ammon, pe ikel ayela ikomgi, dok pe icak lweny ikomgi, pien pe abimiyo dul lobo mo pa jo Ammon me bedo mewu, pien atyeko miyone woko bot likwayo pa Lot me bedo meggi.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Lobo meno bene onongo kilwongo ni lobo pa jo Repaim. Jo Repaim aye yam gukwongo bedo kenyo, ento jo Ammon lwongogi ni jo Jamjummim. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Gin yam gubedo rok madit, ma gipol bene, dok giboco macalo jo Anak; ento Rwot otyekogi woko liweng ki inyimgi, ci jo Ammon gucamo lobogi, ci guleyo kabedogi. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Kitmeno bene Rwot otimo pi likwayo pa Ecau ma gibedo i Ceir, ikare ma otyeko jo Kori woko ki inyimgi, ci likwayo pa Ecau gucamo lobogi, guleyo kabedogi, dok bene pud gibedo iye wa tin. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Dok jo Avim bene mayam gubedo i gangi matino macok ki Gaja, jo Kaptorim aye mayam gubino gua ki i Kaptor, ci gucamo lobo meno ci guleyo kabedogi.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />Ikare ma wawoto wakato Moab, ci Rwot owaco botwa ni, “Wua malo, wucak wot, wucit wungol nota me Arnon. ‘Nen, dong atyeko miyo Cikon i cingwu, ma en aye dano me Amor, rwot me Kecbon, kacel ki lobone. Wucak dong lweny ikome wek wucam lobone woko. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Nen nicake tin, dong abiketo atiba ki lworo madit ikom rok matye piny ite ceng wek ka gibiwinyo pirwu ci komgi bimyel, dok cwinygi bipoto woko lirut.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael guloyo rwot Cikon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Wel 21:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />“Ma omiyo acwalo lukwena nia ki i tim me Kedemot bot Cikon rwot me Kecbon ki lok me kuc, kun awace ni, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />‘Ber iwek awok akat ki i loboni. Ci abicito alubu gudu keken, dok pe Abingak adok tung acuc nyo tung acam. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Ibicata cam me acama ma awilo ki lim, dok ibimiya pii bene me amata ma awilo ki lim. Wek awok akat ki tyena keken, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />kit macalo likwayo pa Ecau ma gibedo i Ceir, ki jo Moab ma gibedo i Ar yam gutimo, nio ka angolo Jordan akato wa i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawa bimiyowa.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Ento Cikon rwot me Kecbon pe oye ni wawok ki i lobone; pien Rwot Lubangawu omiyo toke odoko tek dok odoko lajemo bene, wek emii en i cingwu, wek wacam lobone odok mewa macalo otimeni. <verse eid="DEU 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />Ci Rwot owaco bota ni, ‘Nen, dong acako miyo Cikon ki lobone woko i cingi: cak dong camone wek wule lobone obed mewu.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Ci Cikon ocore obino ikomwa, en ki lwake ducu kalweny i Jakaj. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Ci Rwot Lubangawa omiyo en i cingwa, ci waloyo en ki awobene ki lwake ducu. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Ikare meno wamayo taune madito ducu, dok wajwerogi woko liweng, co wa ki mon wa ki lutino ducu. Pe waweko ngat mo odong. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Watero leegi makwo ducu dok bene wayako taun gi mayam wamayoni woko liweng. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Rwot Lubangawa omiyo wamayo taun ducu nia ki i Aroer matye i dog nota me Arnon, wa ki taun matye i nota nio wa i Gilead. Pe tye taun mo ma kigero mamalo tutwal ma mayone oloyowa. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Ento lobo pa likwayo pa Ammon keken aye yam pe wunyiko cok kwede, ki lobo ducu ma i dog kulu Jabok, ki taun ma i lobo godi, ki kama Rwot Lubangawa ojukuwa pireni ducu.”<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael guloyo rwot Og</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Wel 21:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />“Ka dok waloke, wacito tung kumalo i yoo ma dok i Bacan; ci Og rwot me Bacan ocore obino ikomwa, en ki lwake ducu, kalweny i Edrei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Ento Rwot owaco bota ni, ‘Pe ilwore; pien dong atyeko miyo en ki lwake ducu kacel ki lobone i cingi; ibitimo en kit mayam itimo ikom Cikon rwot pa jo Amor, mayam bedo i Kecbon.’ <verse eid="DEU 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />Kitmeno Rwot Lubangawa omiyo Og rwot me Bacan i cingwa bene, ki lwake ducu; ci waloye, wanekogi nio ka danone mo pe ma odong. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Ikare meno wamako taun pyere abicel matye ite ker pa Og me Bacan ma cokcok ki lobo me Argob ducu. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Magi ducu onongo taun madito ma kicegogi woko ki cel matek mutinge malo likung, ma gitye ki dog celgi ma kicegogi ki rii, dok bene taun mukene matinotino onongo gitye ma pe kikwano mapol ma pe kicelogi ki cel. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Wajwero taun gi woko liweng, dok bene waneko co wa ki mon ki lutino ducu kit mayam watimo ikom Cikon rwot me Kecbon. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Ento lee makwo ducu ki jami ma wayako ki i taun gi watero odoko mewa. <verse eid="DEU 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />Kitmeno ikare ca wakwanyo lobo meno ki i cing luker aryo pa jo Amor mayam gitye loka Jordan, nia ki i nota me Arnon nio wa ikom got Kermon. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />(Jo me Cidon gilwongo Kermon ni, Cirion, ento jo Amor gilwongo ni Cenir.) <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Yam wamako taun ducu ma iwi cere, kacel ki lobo Gilead ducu ki Bacan, nio kwede wa i Caleka ki Edrei, ma gin aye taun ma gitye ite ker pa Og i lobo Bacan. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />(Pien Og rwot me Bacan en aye yam onongo odong kene ki ikin jo Repaim. Nen, kitandane yam obedo kitanda nyonyo ma bore romo mita angwen ki lace mita aryo. Dok bene pud tye i Raba ma en taun madit pa jo Ammon.” )<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaka ma gunongo kabedo inge Jordan tung kunyango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Wel 32:1-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Ikare meno, ma wacamo lobo ma kenyo, an amiyo lobo bot jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Gad, kun wang lobone cake ki i Aroer, ma i dog nota me Arnon, kacel ki nucu lobo godi me Gilead ki taun madito ducu matye iye. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Lobo Gilead mudonge, ki lobo Bacan ducu, en aye lobo Argob ducu, mayam obedo ite ker pa Og, yam amiyo bot nucu kaka pa jo Manace.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 3:13">(Lobo Bacan meno ducu kilwongo ni lobo pa jo Repaim. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Jair, ma jo Manace, yam otero lobo ducu me Argob, en aye Bacan, nio wa iwang apoki me lobo pa jo Gecur ki pa jo Maaka, ci ocako nying gangine ki nyinge kene ni Kavot-jair, macalo pud tye wa onyo.) <verse eid="DEU 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Ci amiyo lobo Gilead bot Makir; <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />ki bot jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Gad amiyo lobo ma a ki i Gilead cito kwede wa i nota me Arnon, kun wang lobone obedo cwiny kulu, nio kwede wa i kulu Jabok, ma en aye wang lobo pa jo Ammon. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Amiyo botgi Araba bene, ma Jordan aye wang apokine, nia wa i nam me Kineret nio kwede i nam me Araba, en aye nam me Kado matye i pwor got me Piciga, ma tung kunyango.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 1:12-15">Yoc 1:12-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dok yam acikowu ikare meno kun awaco ni, “Rwot Lubangawu dong otyeko miyowu lobo man wucam obed mewu. Oteka lwenywu ducu myero gukat loka ca inyim omegiwu jo Icrael kun nongo guruku jami lwenygi. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Ento monwu ki lutinowu matino ki leewu makwo, (pien angeyo ni wutye ki lee madwong), gin gibidong i taun madito ma dong amiyo botwuni. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Wukony omegiwu nio ka Rwot dong bimiyo ki gin kayweyo, kit ma en omiyowu kayweyoni, ma dong gin bene gucamo lobogi ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyogi loka Jordan. Ci lacen wun wubidwogo, kun ngat acel acel dwogo i dul lobone ma dong amiyowuni. <verse eid="DEU 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />Ikare meno bene yam aciko Yocwa ni, ‘In dong ityeko neno ki wangi gin ducu ma Rwot Lubangawu otiyo ikom luker meno aryonu; Rwot dok bitimo kitmeno bene ikom ker ducu ma wubio iye ka wukato loka ca. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Pe wulworgi, pien Rwot Lubangawu aye tye kalweny pirwu.’<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga pe oye Moses oo i lobo Kanaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 27:12-14">Wel 27:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:48-52">Nwo 32:48-52</ref></char>
    </note>Yam abako doga bot Rwot ikare meno kun awaco ni, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />‘Ai Rwot Lubangawa mamalo twal, in pud icako acaka me nyute bota, an latici, kit dit meri ki twero me badi, Lubanga mo pe i polo nyo iwi lobo matwero tiyo kit tic matek tutwal macalo in itiyo! <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Wek kong acit anen lobo maber ca ma loka Jordan, lobo godi maberi, ki Lebanon bene.’ <verse eid="DEU 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />Ento yam kiniga omako Rwot ikoma pirwu, ci pe omedo kiwinya. Rwot owaco bota ni, ‘Wek meno dong oromo! Pe dok inwo loko lok meno bota. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Cit i it malo iwi got Piciga, ci i il wangi malo inen tung kupotoceng, tung kumalo, tung kupiny, ki tung kunyango, wek inen ducu ki wangi, pien pe ibingolo loka Jordan. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Ento in icik Yocwa, icuk cwinye, imiye tek; pien en aye bikato loka ca kun telo wi lwak man, ci bimiyogi camo lobo ma ibinenoni.’” <verse eid="DEU 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Ma omiyo wamede kabedo i nota mukemo Bet-peor.<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s1">Moses ocuku cwiny jo Icrael me bedo luwiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Ci Moses owaco bot jo Icrael ni, “Wuwiny cik ki kop man ma atye ka pwonyowu kwedeni, ci wucobgi, wek wubed makwo, ci wubicito wuo i lobo ma Rwot Lubanga pa kwarowu tye ka miyowu, wek wucam obed mewu. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:18-19">Niy 22:18-19</ref></char></note> Pe wumed lok mo ikom cik ma atye kacikowu kwedeni. Pe wukwany lok mo woko ki ikome, dok wugwok cik pa Rwot Lubangawu ma atye kacikowu kwede ducu. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-9">Wel 25:1-9</ref></char></note>Yam wuneno ki wangwu gin ma Rwot otimo iwi got Baal-peor; pien yam Rwot Lubangawu okwanyo jo ducu ma gulubu jok Baal me Peor ki ikinwu, ci onekogi woko; <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />ento wun jo mayam wuketo genwu ikom Rwot Lubangawu pud wutye makwo ducu wa tin. <verse eid="DEU 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />Nenu, dong atyeko pwonyowu ki cik mapatpat ki gin ma Rwot ongolo, macalo Rwot Lubangana ocika kwede, wek wulubgi i lobo ma wucok donyo iye me camoneni. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Wugwokgi, wucobgi, pien meno aye bibedo ryekowu ki ngeyo pinywu inyim rok mukene. Ka gin biwinyo lwak cik magi ducu ci gibiwaco ni, ‘Adada, rok man maditi tye ki ryeko, dok gin lwak ma gingeyo piny.’ <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />Pien pe tye rok mukene madit ma lubangagi bedo cok kwedgi macalo Rwot Lubangawa bedo cok kwedwa ikare ducu ma wakok bote. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Dok pe tye rok madit mo matye ki lwak cik ki kop ma kingolo atir marom ki cik man ma tin aketo i nyimwuni.<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Ento myero wunen maber ni wugwoke kenwu ki cwinywu ducu, wek wiwu pe owil ikom gin ma wuneno ki wangwu, wek pire pe oa woko ki i cwinywu ikare me kwowu ducu. Wutit bot lutinowu ki likwayowu wek gunge <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />kit mayam wucung kwede inyim Rwot Lubangawu i Koreb, ci inino meno Rwot owaco bota ni, ‘Cok lwak kacel bota, wek amii guwiny loka, gupwony lworo an pi kare ducu ma gibedo kwede iwi loboni, dok gin bene gupwony ki lutinogi.’ <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16-18">Nia 19:16-18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:18-19">Ibru 12:18-19</ref></char></note>Ci yam wubino cok, ci wucung ite got ma onongo got tye ka wang ki mac ma olic wa i polo, i dye colpiny ki pol ma ocido licuc. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Ci Rwot yam oloko kwedwu ki i dye mac. Yam wuwinyo dwon ngat maloko, ento pe wuneno kom gin mo; wuwinyo dwon keken. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:18">Nia 31:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:28">34:28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:10">Nwo 9:10</ref></char></note>En yam otito botwu pi gicikene ma en ocikowu ni wucobi, en aye Cik apar ma en ocoyogi i kidi aryo ma apada. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:1">Nia 21:1</ref></char></note>Ikare meno Rwot ocika ni apwonywu ki cik ducu ki gin ma en ongolo ducu, wek wulubgi i lobo ma wubicito loka ca ka camoneni.”<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ma gengo woro cal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />Ci Moses owaco ki jo Icrael ni, “Ikare mayam Rwot oloko kwedwu i Koreb ki i dye mac ca, pe wuneno kom mo; <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Nia 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lev 26:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:8">Nwo 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:15">27:15</ref></char></note>pimeno wugwoke wek pe wubal pi payo cal mo pirwu kenwu, kadi cal kom gin mo keken maporo laco nyo dako, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:23">Rom 1:23</ref></char></note>nyo maporo lee mo matye iwi lobo, nyo winyo mo ma tuk ki bwome, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />nyo gin mo ma lak alaka i ngom, nyo rec mo keken. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Dok wugwoke wek ka wuilo wangwu malo i polo; ka wuneno ceng ki dwe ki lwak lakalatwe ma i polo, ci cwinywu pe oterwu karyebe piny inyimgi ka worogi. Rwot Lubangawu omiyo magi bot rok ducu ma iwi lobo. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Nia 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">Nwo 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:18">26:18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref></char></note>Ento yam Rwot olarowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt, ki i rukmac ca ma otwak, wek wubed jone kikome macalo ikare man. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:12">Wel 20:12</ref></char></note>Dok bene yam kiniga omako Rwot ikoma pirwu, ci okwongo kwong ni an pe abingolo kulu Jordan, dok bene pe abidonyo i lobo maber ma Rwot Lubangawu tye kamiyowu me aleyawu. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />En bene owaco ni an abito woko ki i lobo man, dok pe abimedo kingolo loka Jordan; ento wun aye wubingolo wukato loka ca pi camo lobo ca maber tutwali. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Wugwoke wek wiwu pe owil ikom gicike pa Rwot Lubangawu mayam en ocike kwedwu wek pe wutii cal apaya mo maporo kom gin mo mayam Rwot Lubangawu okwero ni pe wutii. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:29">Ibru 12:29</ref></char></note>Pien Rwot Lubangawu en mac ma wango piny woko liweng, en Lubanga ma lanyeko<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />Ka dong wunywalo lutino ki likwayo, ma dong wudike i lobo ca, kace wupoto ibal kekenwu pi tiyo cal apaya maporo kom gin mo keken, ka wutimo gin manen marac iwang Rwot Lubangawu, ci wubimiyo kiniga make ikomwu. <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />Tin dong alwongo polo ki lobo gubed caden botwu ikom lok man ni, ka pe wulubu lok man wubito wutum woko oyotoyot ki i lobo ma dong wucok ngolo Jordan ka camone; dok pe wubirii iye kare malac, ento gibityekowu woko liweng. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:36">Nwo 28:36</ref></char></note>Dok Rwot biketowu woko ata ikin rok mapatpat, ci wubidong ma welwu nok tutwal i dye lurok kama Rwot biryemowu wucito iye. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Ki i rok kunu wubiworo iye lwak lubanga mapol ma kipayo calgi ki ikom bao nyo ki ikom got ma kitiyo ki cing dano, ma pe gineno piny, dok bene pe giwinyo lok, pe gicamo, dok bene pe gingweyo piny. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:13">Jer 29:13</ref></char></note>Ento ki i lobo kunu en aye wubicako lega iye bot Rwot Lubangawu ci en biwinyowu, ka wulego bote ki cwinywu ducu. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Ka piny oloyowu, ma dong gin meno ducu opoto ikomwu ikare me lacen, ci wubiloke wudwogo cen bot Rwot Lubangawu, ci wubiworo doge. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Pien Rwot Lubangawu en Lubanga ma lakica: pe bitenyowu ata, pe bityekowu woko, wiye pe biwil ikom gicike mayam ocike bot kwarowu, mayam okwongo pire botgi.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />Kong wupeny pi gin mayam otime con ca, mayam okwongo nyimwu cake ikom nino mayam Lubanga ocweyo iye dano iwi lobo. Kong wupeny kite nia ikin piny ducu, ka yam nyo gin madit macalo man kong otiine, nyo yam kong ki winyo pire kamo. <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Yam kong tye rok mo ma guwinyo dwon lubanga mo maloko kun a ki i dye mac, kit mayam wun wuwinyo, ci pud gubedo makwo? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Nyo yam kong lubanga mo otemo cito kakwanyo rok mo me bedo pire kene ki ikin rok mukene marom ki gin ducu mayam Rwot Lubangawu otimo pirwu i lobo Ejipt kun wuneno ki wangwu? Rwot onyutu twerone i yo mapol, ki lanyut ki tango madongo; dok bene otiyo gin makelo lworo madwong. <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:32">Mar 12:32</ref></char></note>Yam kinyutu botwu wek wunge ni Rwot aye Lubanga; pe tye Lubanga mo mukene doki. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Oweko wuwinyo dwone ma a ki i polo pi tiro kitwu; dok onyutu botwu mace madit iwi lobo, ka dok wuwinyo dwone ki i dye mac. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />En yam omaro kwariwu, omiyo en oyerowu, ci okwanyowu woko ki i Ejipt pi teke madwong ma en kikome tye kwedwu. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />En oryemo rok madito ki matego makatowu ki inyimwu pi kelowu i lobogi, wek omii lobogi botwu wek wucam obed mewu macalo ikare man. <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Myero dong wunge tin, dok wuket icwinywu ni, Rwot aye Lubanga matye malo i polo ki piny iwi lobo; pe tye mo mukene. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Pimeno wumak cike ki gin ma ociko ducu ma tin acikowu kwede, wek nyimwu obed leng, ki nyim lutinowu ma bilubuwu bene obed leng, wek wurii pi kare malac i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu tye ka miyowu matwal.”<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taun me laro luneko matye tung kunyango me Jordan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Nwo 19:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 20:8-9">Yoc 20:8-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare meno Moses opoko taun adek pat tung kunyango me Jordan, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />wek lunek dano ma nongo pe guneko luwotgi akaka, kun nongo mone mo pe ikin gi guring iye gular komgi wek pe kinekgi ka guo i taun magi. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Bejer ma i tim ma obedo cerecere pi jo pa Reuben, Ramot i Gilead pi jo pa Gad ki Golan i Bacan pi jo pa Manace.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Acaki miyo cik pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Man aye cik mayam Moses omiyo bot jo Icrael; <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />gin aye lok me caden ducu, ki cik ki gin ma kingolo ducu mayam Moses oloko bot jo Icrael ikare ma dong gua woko ki i Ejipt. <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />En oloko botgi ki i loka Jordan, i nota ma okemo Bet-peor, i lobo pa Cikon rwot pa jo Amor mayam bedo i Kecbon, mayam Moses ki jo Icrael guloyo ka dong gua woko ki i Ejipt. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Gucamo lobone ki lobo pa Og rwot me Becan, gin luker aryo pa jo Amor mayam gubedo loka Jordan tung kunyango. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Wang lobone ocake ki i Aroer ma i dog nota me Arnon ocito kwede wa i got Cirion, ma en aye Kermon, <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />kacel ki Araba ducu ma i tung kunyango me Jordan o kwede wa i nam me Araba ma i pwor got me Piciga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s1">Cik apar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Nia 20:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Moses olwongo jo Icrael ducu ci owaco botgi ni, “Wun jo Icrael, wuwiny cik ducu ki gin ma kingolo ma aloko tin ma wuwinyo ki itwu; myero wupwonye ikomgi dok wugwoke wek wulubgi. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Yam Rwot Lubangawa oketo gicike kwedwa i Koreb. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Rwot yam pe oketo gicike man ki kwarowa keken, ento ocike kwedwa bene wan jo ducu ma watye kany tin makwoni. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Rwot yam oloko kwedwu wang ki wang ite got ki i dye mac. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Ikare meno an acung ikin Rwot ki wun kun atito botwu lok pa Rwot; pien yam wubedo kalworo mac, ci pe wumedo ki ito malo wa iwi got.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">En yam owaco ni, <verse eid="DEU 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />‘An a Rwot Lubangawu mayam akwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt, iot me opii.<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />Pe wuwor lubanga mukene, kono an kena.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lev 26:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:15-18">Nwo 4:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:15">27:15</ref></char>
    </note>Pe wuyub cal apaya mo, nyo cal gin mo matye malo i polo, nyo gin matye piny iwi lobo, nyo gin matye i pii ma ite lobo. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">Nia 34:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Wel 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:9-10">Nwo 7:9-10</ref></char></note>Pe wuryebe piny inyimgi, pe wuworgi; pien an aye a Rwot Lubangawu, an Lubanga ma lanyeko. Aketo can ikom likwayo pi bal pa kwarogi nio i yalwak me adek ki me angwen pa jo ma daga, <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />ento anyutu mar ma pe loke ikom jo alip ki alip ma gimara, ma gimako cika.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lev 19:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pe wulwong nying Rwot Lubangawu nonono; pien Rwot bimiyo kop loyo dano ma lwongo nyinge nonono.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 16:23-30">Nia 16:23-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:12-14">31:12-14</ref></char>
    </note>Wugwok nino me Cabit, wukwer obed maleng, kit mayam Rwot Lubangawu ocikowu kwede. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:12">Nia 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:15">31:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:21">34:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 35:2">35:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:3">Lev 23:3</ref></char></note>Wubitic matek pi nino abicel, kun wutiyo iye ticwu ducu; <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />ento inino me abirone en aye Cabit pa Rwot Lubangawu. Inino meno pe wugud iye tic mo, wun ki komwu, nyo awobewu, nyo anyirawu, kadi opiiwu nyo angecawu, kadi twon ma mewu nyo kanawu nyo dyangi mo keken, kadi labedo ma bedo i gangwu, wek opiiwu ki angecawu guywe macalo wun. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Myero wupo ni, yam wun wubedo opii i lobo Ejipt, ci Rwot Lubangawu okwanyowu woko ki kunu ki twero me bade ki cinge ma oryeyo; ma omiyo Rwot Lubangawu ocikowu ni wugwok nino me Cabit.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:16">Nwo 27:16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:4">Mat 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:19">19:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:10">Mar 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:2">Epe 6:2</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3">3</ref></char>
    </note>Wor woru ki meni, macalo Rwot Lubangani ociki, wek rii i lobo, dok wek ibed ma nyimi leng, i lobo ma Rwot Lubangani bimiyo botwu.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 9:6">Aca 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:17">Lev 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:21">Mat 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:11">Yak 2:11</ref></char>
    </note>Pe ineki.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:27">Mat 5:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:11">Yak 2:11</ref></char>
    </note>Pe i tim abor.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:11">Lev 19:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">Mat 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom 13:9</ref></char>
    </note>Pe ikwal gin mo.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:1">Nia 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">Mat 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk 18:20</ref></char>
    </note>Pe ibed caden me goba ikom lawoti.<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 7:7">Rom 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">13:9</ref></char>
    </note>Cwinyi pe opuke ikom dako pa lawoti, pe ipar ot pa lawoti, kadi potone, nyo opiine, nyo angecane, nyo twone, nyo kanane nyo kadi gin mo ma lawoti tye kwede.’<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 12:18-19">Ibru 12:18-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot yam oloko lok man bot jowu ma gucoke ducu kun loko ki dwon malongo ki i dye mac ki pol ki colpiny ma ocido licuc; pe dok omedo iye lok mukene. Yam en ocoyo lok man ducu ikom kidi aryo ma apada, ci omiyogi bota.”<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lworo pa lwak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">Nia 20:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />“Ka yam wuwinyo dwon man ma a ki i dye colpiny, kun got tye ka wang ki mac, wubino bota cok, ludito wi kakawu ducu, ki ludongo mewu. <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Ci wuwaco ni, ‘Nen, Rwot Lubangawa dong onyutu botwa deyone ki dite, dok watyeko winyo dwone bene ka kati ki i dye mac; dong tin waneno ka Lubanga loko ki dano ci dano pud bedo makwo. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Dong pingo myero wato kombedi? Pien mac man madit bityekowa woko; ka pud wamede dok kawinyo dwon Rwot Lubangawa maloko kwedwani, ci wabito woko. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Anga ma ikin jo ducu ma gitye ki kom mayam kong owinyo dwon Lubanga makwo maloko ki i dye mac, kit ma wan wawinyoni, ci pud gubedo makwo? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />In inyik cok, iwiny lok ducu ma Rwot Lubangawa biloko, ci itit botwa lok ducu ma Rwot Lubangawa biloko boti; wan wabiwinyo ci wabilubu.’<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />Rwot yam owinyo lokwu ma wuloko botani; ci Rwot owaca ni, ‘Atyeko winyo lok pa jo man ma guloko bota; lok ma guwaco ducu guloko maber. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Kono yam gibedo jwijwi ki cwiny macalo meno, me lwora ki me gwoko cika ducu, wek nyimgi obed leng kacel ki pa lutinogi matwal, kono ber! <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Cit iwac botgi ni dong gudok i kemagi. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Ento in icung cok kangeta kany, ci abititti lok ducu ma aciko, ki lwak cik ki gin ma angolo ducu ma ibipwonyogi kwede, wek gulubgi i lobo ma atye kamiyogi me bedo meggi.’<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />Dong wun wugwoke wek wulub gin ma Rwot Lubangawu ocikowu kwede ducu; kun pe wuturu cike mo keken. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Wuwot kun wulubu yo ducu mayam Rwot Lubangawu ocikowu kwede, wek wubed makwo, wek yo nyimwu obed leng, wek wurii pi kare malac i lobo ma wubicamo doko mewu.”<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s1">Cik madit makato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />“Magi aye cik ducu, ki gin ma Rwot Lubangawu ongolo ni apwonywu kwede, wek wulubgi i lobo ma wubicito iye loka ca ka camone. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Piman wulwor Rwot Lubangawu, wun kikomwu ki likwayowu, kun wugwoko cike ducu ki lok ducu ma en ociko ma atye ka cikowu kwede, nino ducu me kwo mewu, wek wurii iwi lobo pi kare malac. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Pimeno, wun jo Icrael wuwiny, wugwoke wek wulubgi, wek nyimwu obed leng, wek wunya bene mapol, kit ma Rwot Lubanga pa kwarowu yam owaco botwu i lobo ma miu ma ceko cam mabup.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 12:29">Mar 12:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wuwiny, wun jo Icrael: Rwot Lubangawa en Rwot acel. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:37">Mat 22:37</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:30">Mar 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:27">Luk 10:27</ref></char></note>Mar Rwot Lubangani ki cwinyi ducu, ki tipuni ducu ki teki ducu. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:18-20">Nwo 11:18-20</ref></char></note> Pe wuwek wiwu owil ilok magi ducu ma acikowu kwede tini. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Wubipwonyo lutinowu kwedgi matek. Wupwonygi kwede ka wubedo i odiwu, ki ka wutye kawot i yoo, ka wubutu piny ki ka wua malo. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Wutwe i ngut cingwu ki wutwe bene itur nyimwu me lapo wiwu. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Dok wubicoyo ikom okar dogola me odiwu, ki i dog gangwu.”<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma bipoto ikom ludingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:7">Aca 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28:13</ref></char>
    </note>“Rwot Lubangawu dong otyeko kwonge bot kwariwu Abraim, bot Icaka ki bot Yakobo ni ebimiyowu lobo ma etye ka terowu iyeni. Lobo matye ki taun madito ma gibeco mayam pe wun aye wugerogi. <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />Odi ma gupong ki jami ducu ma gibeco mayam pe wun aye wupongo igi, ki bur pii ma kikwinyogi ma pe wun aye wukwinyogi, ki poto olok ki poto jeituni ma pe wun aye wupitogi. Ka dong wucamo wuyeng, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />ci ber wugwoke wek wiwu pe owil woko ikom Rwot mayam okwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt, i ot me opii. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:8">Luk 4:8</ref></char></note>Wulwor Rwot Lubangawu, wutii pi en, wukwong kwongwu ki nyinge. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Pe wuwor lubanga mukene ducu, macalo lwak lubanga pa rok mapatpat ma birumuwu dyere, <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />pien Rwot Lubangawu matye ikinwu ni en Lubanga ma lanyeko; wek kiniga pe omak Rwot Lubangawu ikomwu, miyo en bityekowu woko liweng ki iwi lobo.<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Nia 17:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:7">Mat 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:12">Luk 4:12</ref></char>
    </note>Pe wuom i Rwot Lubangawu, macalo yam wuomo kwede iye i Maca. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Omyero wunen ni wuketo cwinywu kagwoko cik ducu, ki lok me caden ducu ma Rwot Lubangawu ocikowu kwede. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Wutii gin ducu matye atir dok ber iwang Rwot. Pien ka wutiyo meno, ci biweko wubibedo maber, dok wubicito ci wubicamo lobo ma ceko cam mayam Rwot okwongo pire ni ebimiyo botwu, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />kun biryemo lukworwu woko ducu ki inyimwu, macalo Rwot yam ociko.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />Ikare me anyim, ka lutinoni bipenyi ni, ‘Pingo Rwot Lubangawa ocikowa me lubu cik ki caden magi ducu?’ <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Ci Wubidok iye ni, ‘Wan yam onongo wabedo opii pa Parao i Ejipt, ci Rwot okwanyowa ki i Ejipt pi teko mere madit. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Yam Rwot onyutu lwak lanyut ki tango madito dok malik tutwal ikom lobo Ejipt ki ikom Parao ki ikom jo ma i ode ducu ma waneno ki wangwa. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />En okwanyowa woko ki i lobo Ejipt wek ekelwa kany, wek eminiwa lobo mayam en okwongo pire ni ebimiyo bot kwarowa. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Kitmeno Rwot yam ocikowa ni walub cik magi ducu, dok ni walwor Rwot Lubangawa wek wabed maber nakanaka, wek en ogwokwa wabed makwo i lobowa kun bene nongo wapong ki gum i iye kit macalo tye katime kombedini. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Ka wagwoke kun walubu cik magi ducu ma Rwot Lubangawa ocikowa kwede ci wabibedo jo ma kitwa atir inyime.’”<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s1">Jo pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Nia 34:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 13:19">Tic 13:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Rwot Lubangawu tye katerowu i lobo ma wubidonyo iye kacamone me bedo mewu. En biryemo rok mapol woko ki inyimwu, jo Kit, jo Girgac, jo Amor, jo Kanaan, jo Periji, jo Kiv ki jo Jebuc, gin rok ducu abiro ma gidito dok gitego makatowu. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Ka Rwot Lubangawu omiyogi i cingwu ci wubiloyogi woko, ci omyero wudyergi i cing Rwot, kun wujwergi woko liweng. Pe wuket gicike mo kwedgi, dok pe wutimgi kica. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Pe wunyome kwedgi, dok bene pe wuwek lutinowu gunyome kwedgi. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Pien gibiloko cwiny lutinowu woko miyo pe dok gibiwora ento gibiworo lubanga mogo mukene; ci bimiyo kiniga mako Rwot ikomwu ci en bityekowu woko oyot. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:3">Nwo 12:3</ref></char></note>Ento wubitimogi kit man: wubimuku keno jogigi woko, wubinginyo wir jogi woko, wubitongo yadi ma kipitogi kama giworo iye jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera, kiwango cal apayagi ki mac.<verse eid="DEU 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Nia 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Nwo 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:18">26:18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref></char>
    </note>Pien wun aye wudoko jo maleng pi Rwot Lubangawu, Rwot Lubangawu otyeko yerowu ki ikin rok ducu matye iwi lobo wek wubed jone kikome. <verse eid="DEU 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />Rwot Lubangawu pe omarowu dok pe oyerowu ni pien wun aye welwu dwong makato rok mukeneni ducu; wun aye yam onongo wunok maloyo ki ikin rok ducu. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Ento Rwot yam okwanyowu woko ki twero me bade, okokowu ki i ot me opii ki i cing Parao rwot me Ejipt pien en marowu, dok tye kacobo kwong mayam en okwongo bot kwarowu. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5-6">Nia 20:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">34:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Wel 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:9-10">Nwo 5:9-10</ref></char></note>Myero dong wunge ni, Rwot Lubangawu en Lubanga kikome, Lubanga ma gene, ma gwoko gicikene, dok gwoko mar mere ma pe loke bot jo ma gimare ki ma gimako lok ma en ociko ducu, nio wa i yalwak alip kulu. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Dok en pe bigale kaculu kwor ikom jo ma gikwere kikomgi, kun nekogi woko. En pe bijalo dano ma okwere; biculu kwor ikom dano meno kikome. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Pimeno wugwoke wek wulub lok ma en ociko ki cik ducu ki gin ma en ongolo ducu ma acikowu kwede tin.”<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gum ma bino pi bedo lawiny</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Lev 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Nwo 28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 11:13-17">Nwo 11:13-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Moses omede ki lok bot jo Icrael ni, “Kace wun wubiwinyo cik magi ducu ma kicikoni, kun wugwokogi dok wulubugi, ci bimiyo Rwot Lubangawu bene bigwoko gicikene kwedwu, ki mar mere ma pe loke mayam en okwongo pire bot kwariwu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />En bimarowu, bimiyowu gum, dok bimiyo wubinya mapol. En bimiyo gum ikom lutino ma wubinywalo ki ikom cam ma bicek i potiwu, nganowu ki kongo bwinowu ki moowu, ki dyangiwu ki romiwu binya, bibedo mapol i lobo mayam en okwongo pire bot kwariwu ni ebimiyowu. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />En bimiyowu gum makato pa rok ducu; laco mo nyo dako mo ma lalur pe binen ikinwu nyo ikin limwu makwo. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Rwot bigwokowu ki ikit two ducu. En pe biketo kit two mo ikomwu ikin two maracu me Ejipt ma wun wungeyoni, ento en biketogi ikom jo ducu ma kwerowu. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Wun bene wubityeko rok ducu ma Rwot Lubangawu biketogi i cingwu; kica pe omakwu ikomgi. Pe wubiworo lubangagi, pien bidoko owic botwu.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />Pe wulwod lok ki i cwinywu ni, ‘Rok magi ducu gin gidito makato wan, wabiryemogi ningning?’ <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Pe wubibedo ki lworo mo ikomgi, ento wubipo gin mayam Rwot Lubangawu otiyo ikom Parao ki ikom jo Ejipt ducu. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Wubipo kit mayam otemo kwede cwinygi ki tic madito kun wuneno ki wangwu, kacel ki lanyut ki tango mapol, ki twero me bade ki cinge ma oryeyo, ma Rwot Lubangawu yam okwanywu kwede woko ki i Ejipt. Rwot Lubangawu bitiyo kitmeno ikom rok ducu ma wutye kalworogini. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Dok bene Rwot Lubangawu bicoro pino jobi ikin gi, nio wang ma jo mayam gudong, ki jo ma gikane woko ki botwu dong kinekogi woko. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Pe atiba omakwu ikomgi, pien Rwot Lubangawu tye ikinwu, ma en Lubanga madit ma ryango kom dano. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Rwot Lubangawu bijwero rok magi woko ki inyimwu motmot; pe wutwero tyekogi ducu oyotoyot, miyo gitim bimede mapol, ma okato komwu woko. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Ento Rwot Lubangawu bimiyogi i cingwu, ci man biryango komgi matek tutwal, nio ka wutyekogi woko. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Dok en bimiyo lukergi i cingwu, ci wubimiyo nyinggi rwenyo woko ki ite polo. Pe binen dano mo ma bicung kalweny ikomwu, nio ka wutyekogi woko. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Cal lubangagi ma kipayo apaya bene wubiwangogi woko ki mac. Pe wubiparo ryal ki jabu ma kimwono ikomgi, pe wubikwanyo mo me bedo mewu, wek pe odok owic me makowu; pien meno aye gin me kwer mada ki bot Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Pimeno pe wubikelo gin me kwer i odiwu, miyo lakit acena ma kiceno ki jo ma gidagwu kwedeni donyo i odiwu. Omyero wukwer woko adada, wuca pirgi woko matwal, pien Rwot dong otyeko cenogi woko.”<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s1">Lobo maber ma jo Icrael bileyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />“Wulub cik ducu ma tin atye kacikowu kwedeni maber, wunen ni wulubugi, wek wubed makwo, wunya mapol, wucit wucam lobo ca mayam Rwot okwongo pire me miyo bot kwariwu. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Dok omyero wupo kom yo ducu mayam Rwot Lubangawu otelowu iye i tim pi mwaka pyere angwen, wek omii wudok mamwol, kun temo iwu wek onge gin matye i cwinywu, ka nyo wubimako cike, nyo pe. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:4">Mat 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:4">Luk 4:4</ref></char></note>Kitmeno en omiyo wudoko mamwol, dok omiyo kec onekowu, ci opitowu ki manna ma onongo yam pe wungeyo, kadi wa kwariwu bene yam pe gungeyo; wek oniangwu ni, dano pe bedo kwo ki kwon keken, ento dano kwo ki lok ducu ma a ki i dog Rwot. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Ikin mwaka pyere angweni kulu bongi arukawu yam pe guti gutum woko ki ikomwu, dok tyenwu bene yam pe okwot. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Dong omyero wunge ki i cwinywu ni, Rwot Lubangawu tye katiro kitwu macalo dano tiro kwede kit latine. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Pimeno, wugwok cik pa Rwot Lubangawu ducu, kun bene wuwoto ma wulubu yone dok kun wulwore. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Pien Rwot Lubangawu tye katerowu i lobo maber, ma opong ki lwak nota ora ma igi ki pii, ki wang it, ki wang pii malongo, ma gimol ki i nota ki iwi godi. <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />En lobo maceko ngano ki cayiri, ki maceko olok ki oduru ki okwer pomegranat, lobo ma moo jeituni ki moo kic dwong iye. <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />En lobo ma wubicamo iye cam mabup labongo can gin mo, kama gin mo pe birem iye botwu; en lobo ma gwenge bedo nyonyo iron, kama wubikwinyo iye nyonyo mola ki i cere. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Wubicam wubiyeng, ci wubipwoyo Rwot Lubangawu pi lobo maber ma en omiyo botwu.”<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wilwic ikom Rwot bikelo can</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 13:5-6">Koc 13:5-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Wugwoke kekenwu wek pe wiwu owil woko ikom Rwot Lubangawu, kun pe dong wugwoko lok ma en ociko; ki gin ma ongolo, ki lwak cike ducu ma atye kacikowu kwede tin. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Ka dong wucamo, wuyeng, ma dong wugero odi mabeco ma wubedo iye, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />dok ka dyangiwu ki romiwu dong onya mapol, ki ryalwu ki jabuwu omede madwong, ki jami ducu ma wutye kwedgi dong onya omede madwong, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />ci pe wuwek wiwu ocak doko dito dok bene pe wiwu owil woko ikom Rwot Lubangawu, mayam okwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt, ki i ot me opii ca. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Pe wuwek wiwu owil woko ni en aye mayam otelo wiwu kun wuwok kwede i tim malac ki malik bene, matye iye lwak twol ma kwirgi kec, ki oton, ki lobo ma orwo pii neko iye dano, ma pii pe iyeni, ci en okeliwu pii ma oa ki i pata got. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />En bene opitowu i tim ki manna mayam kwariwu pe gingeyo, wek olokwu wudok mwol, kun temo ki cwinywu, wek otimwu ber lacen. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Wugwoke wuwek lwodo lok ki i cwinywu ni, ‘Tek koma ki twero me bada gira aye omiyo alimo lonyo man.’ <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Wun wubipo ikom Rwot Lubangawu, pien en aye ma miyowu tek me limo lonyo; wek en omok gicikene mayam okwongo pire bot kwarowu, macalo pud tye wa kombedi. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Kace wiwu owil woko ikom Rwot Lubangawu, ce wucako lubu kor lwak lubanga mukene, ki tiyo botgi ki ryebe piny inyimgi, ci nen atito botwu atyer tin ni, wubito wubitum woko liweng. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Ka pe wuworo dog Rwot Lubangawa, ci wubito wubitum woko macalo lurok ma Rwot tye kamiyogi to gitum woko ki i nyimwuni.”<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s1">Adwogi me jemo ikom Rwot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 32:1-35">Nia 32:1-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />“Wuwiny, wun jo Icrael; wubikato loka Jordan tin, wek wucit kaleyo lobo pa rok madito ki matego makatowu, ki taun gi bene madito, ma kigoyo iye cel matek ma o wa i pol, <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />rok madit ma giboco, likwayo pa jo Anak, ma wungeyogi, mayam dong wuwinyo nyinggi kun kiwaco ni, ‘Anga matwero cung inyim likwayo pa Anak?’ <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Pimeno myero wunge lok man tin ni, ngat matye kawot inyimwu macalo mac ma wango piny en aye Rwot Lubangawu; en aye bityekogi, en aye bitayogi woko ki inyimwu, miyo wubiryemogi woko dok gito gitum woko oyot, macalo Rwot owaco botwuni.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />Ka dong Rwot Lubangawu otyeko ryemogi woko ki inyimwu, pe wulwod lok ki i cwinywu ni, ‘Pien wan wabedo ma kitwa atir en aye omiyo Rwot okelowa kacamo loboni.’ Omyero wunge ni, Rwot biryemo rok magi ki inyimwu pi bal maracu ducu ma gin gutimo. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Pe wubicito kacamo lobogi pi kitwu ma atir, nyo pi leng iwu, ento pi bal maracu ma rok meno ducu gutimo en aye omiyo Rwot Lubangawu biryemogi woko ki inyimwu, dok wek ocob lok mayam okwongo bot kwarowu Abraim ki Icaka ki Yakobo.”<verse eid="DEU 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jemo pa jo Icrael i Koreb</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 31:18-32:35">Nia 31:18—32:35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />“Omyero dong wunge ni, pe pi kitwu ma atir en aye omiyo Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu lobo man maberi wek wucam; pien wun jo ma ngutwu tek. <verse eid="DEU 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />Ber wupo, dok bene wiwu pe owil kit mayam Rwot Lubangawu obedo ki akemo i tim. Nia wa inino mayam wua iye ki i lobo Ejipt, o kwede wa ikare ma wuo i kabedoni, wun wubedo lujemo ikom Rwot. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Kadi wa i Koreb bene wumiyo Rwot obedo ki akemo, ci yam Rwot kiniga omake ikomwu tutwal, omiyo obwot tyekowu woko. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:18">Nia 24:18</ref></char></note>Ikare mayam aito malo iwi got kagamo kidi aryo ma apadani, kidi me gicike mayam Rwot oketo kwedwu, ci abedo iwi got, ari nino pyere angwen dyeceng ki dyewor kun pe acamo dok pe amato pii bene. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Ci Rwot omiya kidi aryo ma apada ma Lubanga onongo ocoyo ki cinge, kun ocoyo ikomgi lwak lok ducu mayam Rwot obedo kaloko iwi got ki i dye mac, inino mayam lwak ocoke iye ca. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Ka nino pyere angwen ki dyewor pyere angwen dong okato, Rwot omiya kidi meno aryo ma apada, gin kidi me gicike. <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />Ka dok Rwot owaco bota ni, ‘A malo, icit ilor piny ki kany oyot, pien joni mayam ikelogi ki i Ejipt gutyeko bale woko. Guloke, gubare woko oyot nia ki i yo mayam acikogi kwede, gutimo gigi cal jabu ma guliyo aliya.’<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Rwot dok omede ki lok kun waco bota ni, ‘Atyeko neno jo man, ci nen, gin jo ma ngutgi tek. <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Weka gira, wek dong atyekgi woko liweng; abijwayo nyinggi woko ki ite polo, ci abimiyo in i doko rok matek tutwal ki madit makatogi.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />Ci aloke, alor piny ki iwi got, kun got tye kawang ki mac. Onongo amako kidi apada aryo me gicike ki cinga aryo ducu. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Ka aneno, ci nen, wutyeko timo bal inyim Rwot Lubangawu. Onongo wutimo giwu cal wod twon ma kiliyo aliya, kun wuloke, wubare woko oyot ki i yo mayam Rwot ocikowu kwedeni. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Ci amako kidi aryo ma apada ca, abologi woko piny ki i cinga aryo ducu, atyerogi woko ki inyimwu. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Lacen abutu aryeba cwiny inyim Rwot nino pyere angwen dyeceng ki dyewor kit macon ca. Pe acamo, pe amato pii bene pi lwak bal ducu ma wubedo katimone, kun wutimo gin manen marac iwang Rwot ma omiyo kiniga omake. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:21">Ibru 12:21</ref></char></note>Pien onongo lworo omaka pi kiniga pa Rwot ki akecane malyet ikomwu ma onongo cok ka tyekowu woko. Ento Rwot owinya wa ikare meno bene. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Kiniga yam omako Rwot ikom Aron bene matek, omiyo onongo dong cok kaneke woko; ento ikare ca alego pi Aron bene. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Dok akwanyo balwu, en aye wod twon ma wutimoni, ci awango woko ki mac, aodo, arego woko mapwot, nio ka odoko apwa; ci aonyo apwane i kulu mamol piny a ki iwi got.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:3">Wel 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 34">34</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 17:7">Nia 17:7</ref></char>
    </note>Dok bene yam i Tabera, ki i Maca ki i Kibrot-atava wubedo kamiyo Rwot bedo ki akemo. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:25-14:38">Wel 13:25—14:38</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:21">Nwo 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26">26</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:16">Ibru 3:16</ref></char></note>Ka yam Rwot ocwalowu nia ki i Kadec-barnea kun waco ni, ‘Wucit, wucam lobo ma dong amiyowuni,’ ci wujemo woko ikom cik pa Rwot Lubangawu; yam pe wugene, dok pe wuworo doge. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Wun wubedo lujemo ikom Rwot nia wa inino mayam acako ngeyowu iyeni.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />Kitmeno abutu aryeba cwiny inyim Rwot nino pyere angwen dyeceng ki dyewor, pien onongo Rwot owaco ni emito tyekowu woko. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Ci yam alego bot Rwot ni, ‘Ai Rwot Lubanga, pe ityek lwaki woko, ma gin aye joni mayam ikokogi pi diti, ma ikwanyogi woko ki i Ejipt pi twero me badi. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Ber ipo ikom lutici Abraim, Icaka ki Yakobo. Pe ibed kaparo pi tek ngut pa rok man, nyo pi timgi maracu, nyo pi balgi. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Miyo jo me lobo Ejipt biwaco ni, in onongo pe itwero tero joni i lobo mayam iciko pire botgi. Dok gin biwaco ni pien onongo yam idaggi, omiyo ikwanyogi woko, wek inekgi woko i dye tim. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Pien gin aye lwaki, gin joni, ma dong ikelogi woko ki teki madwong ki pi cingi ma iryeyo.’”<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s1">Moses ogamo Cik Apar odoco</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Nia 34:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />Ikare meno Rwot owaco bota ni, “Muk kidi ma apada aryo, ipaagi macalo mukwongo ca; ci ibin bota iwi got malo, dok ipaa canduk me bao. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Abicoyo ikom kidi ma apadanu lok mayam tye ikom kidi ma apada mukwongo mayam ityero woko ca, ci ibiketogi i canduk. <verse eid="DEU 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />Kitmeno apayo canduk ki bao yat okutu lalwii, ci amuku kidi ma apada aryo, apayo marom ki macon ca, ci aito malo iwi got kun amako kidi ma apada aryonu i cinga. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Rwot ocoyo ikom kidinu macalo yam okwongo coyo, gin cik apar mayam oloko ki wun iwi got ki i dye mac inino mayam wucoke iye ca; ci Rwot omiyogi bota. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Lacen aloke, alor piny ki iwi got, ci aketo kidi ma apada aryonu i canduk mayam apayoni; gin pud gitye ene, kit mayam Rwot ocika kwede.<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 20:28">Wel 20:28</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 33:38">33:38</ref></char>
    </note>(Jo Icrael gua ki i Beerot Benejaakan, guo Mocera. Ci Aron oto ki kunu, kiyike bene kunu; ci wode Eleajar oleyo katyene i tic me bedo ajwaka pa Lubanga. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Gua ki kunu, guwoto guo i Gudgoda, ki nia ki i Gudgoda guo Jotibata, en aye lobo matye iye lwak nota ora ma igi ki pii. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-8">Wel 3:5-8</ref></char></note>Ikare meno en aye Rwot ocako poko kaka pa Lulevi pat, wek gubed luting canduk me gicike pa Rwot, ki gucung inyim Rwot kun gitiyo bote, dok gulam gum i nyinge, nio wa inino man. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />En gin ma omiyo jo pa Levi pe gitye ki dul lobo mo nyo ginaleya mo ikin omegigi; Rwot aye ginaleyagi, kit macalo Rwot Lubangawu yam owaco botgi.)<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:28">Nia 34:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yam abedo iwi got macalo ikare mukwongo ca, abedo nino pyere angwen dyeceng ki dyewor; ci Rwot dok owinya ikare meno bene, omiyo Rwot oye pe me tyekowa woko. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Lacen Rwot owaca ni, ‘A malo, imede ki wot kun itelo wi lwak, wek gudony, gucam lobo mayam akwongo pire bot kwarigi ni abimiyogi.’”<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gin ma Lubanga mito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />“Dong kombedi, wun jo Icrael, gin ma Rwot Lubangawu mito ki botwu en ene keken ni, wulwor Rwot Lubangawu ki cwinywu ducu ki tipuwu ducu, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />dok wugwok gin ducu ma en ociko ki cik mapatpat ma acikowu kwede tin wek dong wubed maber. <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Nen, Rwot Lubangawu aye rwot me polo, ki polo mamalo makato ducu, ki lobo ki jami matye ducu liweng. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Ento kadi bed kumeno, Rwot oketo cwinye ikom kwariwu, omarogi, oyero likwayogi ma gulubugi, ma gin aye wun, ki ikin rok ducu macalo wa ikare man. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Pieno, wubed jo ma gulire wa i cwinygi, pe wubed jo ma ngutgi tek. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:15">1 Tem 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:14">Niy 17:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:16">19:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:34">Tic 10:34</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:11">Rom 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:6">Gal 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Epe 6:9</ref></char></note>Pien Rwot Lubangawu aye Lubanga pa lubanga ducu ki Rwot pa rwodi. En Lubanga madit, matye ki tek, ma ryango kom dano; pe dworo kor dano mo, pe kiwilo ki lim. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />En ngolo kop pa lutino kic atir, ki pa mon to, dok maro lubedo bene, miyogi cam ki bongi. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Wun bene myero wumar lubedo, pien yam wubedo lubedo i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Wulwor Rwot Lubangawu; wutii bote kun wumoko ikome matek, dok wukwong kwongwu ki nyinge keken. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />En aye ma myero wupake; en Lubangawu mayam otimo botwu tim man ducu madito ki ma ryango kom dano, ma wangwu dong onenoni. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Aca 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:27">46:27</ref></char></note> Kwariwu yam gucito i Ejipt kun gin jo pyere abiro keken; ci tin Rwot Lubangawu dong omiyo wunya mapol macalo lwak lakalatwe me polo.”<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s1">Dit pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />“Mar Rwot Lubangani, lub cike ikare ducu, cik mapatpat ma oketo ki ongon me cike ki lok ma en ongolo ducu. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Tin dong wutam, (pien pe atye kalok ki lutinowu mayam pe gingeyo dok ma pe guneno), wutam kit ma Rwot Lubangawu opwonyowu kwede pi tiro kitwu, wutam pi dite ki bade matek ki cinge ma oryeyoni, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:8-12:13">Nia 7:8—12:13</ref></char></note>ki lwak lanyut ki tice ma otiyo i Ejipt ikom Parao rwot me Ejipt ki ikom lobone ducu. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />Wun wuneno<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:28">Nia 14:28</ref></char></note>kit gin ma en otimo ikom mony pa jo Ejipt ki ikom aguraguragi ducu ki gadigadigi, ki kit mayam omiyo pii me Nam Makwar omwonyogi woko ikare ma giryemo korwuni, ki kit ma Rwot otyekogi woko kwede nio wa ikare man. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Dok wutam gin mayam otimo ikomwu i tim nio ka wubino wuo i kabedo man. <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:31-32">Wel 16:31-32</ref></char></note>Wupo bene gin ma en otiyo ikom Datan ki Abiram ma awobe pa Eliab wod pa Reuben; ki kit mayam lobo ongamo kwede doge ci omwonyogi woko ki jo ma i odigi ducu ki kemagi ducu. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Pien wutyeko neno ki wangwu tic madito ma Rwot yam otiyo ducu.”<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gum ma binen i lobo ma Rwot ocike pire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />“Wumak cika ducu ma acikowu kwede tini, wek wubed ki tek me cito i lobo ma wubicito loka ca kacamone obed mewu wek wucam. <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />Ci wubirii pi kare malac i lobo mayam Rwot okwongo pire bot kwariwu, ni ebimiyogi wa ki likwayogi bene, en lobo ma miu ma ceko cam mabup. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Pien lobo ma wubidonyo iye kacamoneni pe rom ki lobo Ejipt kama yam wua iyeni, kama yam wucoyo iye kodiwu ka dok wubaro wang piine kikomwu, macalo poto dek ma gicamo poteni. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Ento lobo ma wucito loka ca kacamone me bedo mewu obedo lobo godi ki notagu, ma mato pii kot ma cwer a ki ipolo. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Man aye lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu gwoko; wang Rwot Lubangawu bedo ikome nino ducu, nia i acaki mwaka nio wa i agiki mwaka ducu.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:3-5">Lev 26:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-16">Nwo 7:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28:1-14</ref></char>
    </note>Ka wubilubu cika ducu ma acikowu kwede tin, ni wumar Rwot Lubangawu, wutii bote ki cwinywu ducu ki tipuwu ducu, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />ci en bimiyo kot cwer i lobowu i karene, i poto kot ki kot orogu, wek wubed ki nganowu ki kongo bwinowu ki moowu. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Dok en bimiyowu lum i oletwu me cam pa lim makwo, miyo wubinongo, cam ma yengowu. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Wugwoke wek pe kibwolwu, miyo wuloke: wubare woko, wutiyo bot lwak lubanga mukene, wuworogi bene, <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />miyo kiniga mako Rwot ikomwu, ci gengo polo juku miyo kot pe cwer, miyo lobo pe ceko cam, ci wuto wutum woko oyotoyot ki i lobo maber ma Rwot bimiyowuni.<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />Wubiketo lok magi ducu i cwinywu ki i tamwu; wubitweyogi i ngut cingwu obed me lanyut, dok gubed me atweya i dye tur nyimwu me poyo wiwu. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Wupwony lutinowu ki lok magi, wubed kalok komgi ka wubedo i odiwu, ka wutye kawot i yoo, ka wubutu piny ki ka wua malo.<figure style="fig" alt="The llaw of God on your foreheads" file="HK00274B.TIF" size="col" loc="11:18" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="11:18">Cik pa Lubanga ma kitweyo i tur nyim</figure> <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:6-9">Nwo 6:6-9</ref></char></note>Dok wuco lok magi i yat dogola odiwu, ki i dog gangwu, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />wek wun ki likwayowu wurii pi mwaka mapol i lobo mayam Rwot okwongo pire bot kwariwu ni ebimiyogi pi kare ducu ma polo pud bibedo malo ka wi lobo. <verse eid="DEU 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />Kace wubigwoke wek wulub cik man ducu ma atye ka cikowu kwedeni, kun wumaro Rwot Lubangawu, ma wulubu yone ducu, ma wucung ikome matek. <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />Ci Rwot biryemo rok mukene woko ducu ki inyimwu, miyo wucamo lobo pa rok madito ki matego makatowu. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:3-5">Yoc 1:3-5</ref></char></note>Kabedo ducu ma tyenwu binyono bibedo mewu; ci lobo ma wubiloyo bibedo nia wa i tim nio wa i Lebanon, ki nia wa i kulu Euprate, nio wa i Nam Mediterranean ma tung kupotoceng. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Pe tye dano mo ma bicung inyimwu; Rwot Lubangawu biketo lworo ki atiba pirwu ikom lobo ducu ma tyenwu binyonone, kit mayam ocikowu kwedeni.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />Nen, tin aketo inyimwu gum ki ceno dano: <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />gum bibino kace wubilubu cik pa Rwot Lubangawu ma atye ka cikowu kwede tini. <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />Ento ceno dano bibino kace pe wubilubu cik pa Rwot Lubangawu, ka wuloke kun wubare woko nia ki i yo ma acikowu kwede tini ci dok wulubu kor lubanga mukene mayam pe wungeyo. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:11-14">Nwo 27:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 8:33-35">Yoc 8:33-35</ref></char></note>Ka Rwot Lubangawu dong okelowu i lobo ma wubicito iye kacamoneni, ci wubitucu gum ki ikom got Gerijim, ki acena ki ikom got Ebal. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Godi man gitye loka Jordan, ma but piny tung kupotoceng, i lobo pa jo Kanaan ma gibedo i Araba, ma okemo Gilgal, ma kanget yadi kworo me More. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Wubingolo Jordan, wukato loka ca kacamo lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu. Ka dong wucamo, ma wubedo iye, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />ci wugwoke wek wulub cik ki ongon me cike ducu ma dong aketo inyimwu tin.”<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kabedo acel keken me woro Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />“Magi aye cik ki ongon me cik ma wubimako matek kun wubilubugi i lobo ma Rwot Lubanga pa kwariwu bimiyowu obed mewu, pi kare ducu ma wubibedo iye iwi loboni. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Wubibalo kabedo ducu liweng kama yam rok ducu ma wubigamo lobogi giworo iye lubangagi, ma gitye malo iwi godi mabocone ducu ki iwi cere ki iwang ayweya ma ite yadi ma potgi oluk. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:5">Nwo 7:5</ref></char></note>Wumuk keno jogigi woko ducu, wungid wir jogi meggi woko matinotino, wuwang yadi ma kicomo i ngom pi woro jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera, wutong cal lubanga apayagi woko ducu, wunek nyingi woko ki i kabedogi. <verse eid="DEU 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />Pe wubiworo Rwot Lubangawu ikit yo ma jo Kanaan woro ki lubangagi. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Ento wubipenyo Rwot Lubangawu pi kabedo ma en biyero ki ikin kakawu ducu pi keto iye nyinge wek obed kama kiwore iye. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Kenyo aye wubicito iye, kenyo en aye wubitero iye gitum awanga ki gitum mewu ducu, ki dul acel me apar, ki gityer mapatpat ma wubimiyo, gityer me cobo kwong, ki gityer ma iwu opwoyo, ki lutino kayo pa dyangiwu ki pa romi ki dyegiwu. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Wubicamone ki kunu inyim Rwot Lubangawu, ci cwinywu bibedo yom, wun ki jo ma i odiwu ducu, ikom gin ducu ma wubiketo iye cingwu, ma onongo Rwot Lubangawu omiyowu iye gum.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />Ka wuo kunu, ci pe wubitimo kit ma watye katimo kany i kareni, ma dano acel acel tye katiyo gin ducu ma en tamo ni tye atir i wange; <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />pien peya wuo ikabedo me yweyowu, i lobo ma wubileyo, ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Ento ka dong wukato loka Jordan, ma wubedo i lobo ma Rwot Lubanga bimiyo me aleyawu, ka dong omiyo wuywe ki i lweny ikom lumerokwu ma gurumuwu dyereni, ci dong wubibedo ma piny okwe mot. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Rwot Lubangawu biyero kabedo kama en biketo iye nyinge bedo iye; kenyo en aye wubikelo iye gin ducu ma acikowuni: gitum awangawu, gitum mukene ducu, dul acel me apar, gityer mapatpat ma wubimiyo, ki gityer me cobo kwong ducu ma wukwongo me miyogi bot Rwot. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Ci cwinywu bibedo yom inyim Rwot, wun ki awobewu ki anyirawu, opiiwu ki angecawu ducu, ki Lulevi matye i taunwu, pien gin Lulevi pe kibipoko ki gin dul lobo mo nyo kabedo mo ikinwu me aleyagi. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Wugwoke wek pe wutyer gitum awangawu i kabedo mo keken ma wubineno. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />Ento wubityerone ki i kabedo ma Rwot biyero ki i kakawu mo acel. Wubityero gitum awangawu ducu kunu, dok wubitiyo gin ducu ma acikowuni ki kunu.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />Ento wutwero neko lee me acamawu ki i taunwu ducu kit ma cwinywu mito, ma oporo gum ma Rwot Lubangawu omiyowu. Dano ma kome ki keni twero camo, ki dano ma olony, macalo kicamo ringo abur nyo til. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Aca 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lev 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">Nwo 15:23</ref></char></note>Remone keken aye pe wubicamo; wubionyo woko piny i ngom, macalo pii.<verse eid="DEU 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Pe myero wucam dul acel me apar me nganowu, nyo me kongo bwinowu nyo me moo jeituniwu ki i gangiwu, kadi lutino kayo pa dyangiwu nyo pa romi ki dyegiwu, nyo gityer me cobo kwongwu ma wukwongo, nyo gityer mewu ma cwinywu opwoyo, nyo gityer mo ma wumiyo. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Ento wubicamo ki inyim Rwot Lubangawu i kabedo ma en biyero, wun ki lutinowu, opiiwu, angecawu, ki Lulevi ma igangwu; dok cwinywu bibedo yom inyim Rwot Lubangawu pi gin ducu ma wubiketo iye cingwu. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Wugwoke pe wubwot Lulevi ata ikare ducu ma wubedo i lobowuni.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />Ka Rwot Lubangawu dong oyabo wang lobowu obedo malac, kit mayam ocike kwede botwu, ce iwaco ni, ‘Abicamo ringo,’ pien onongo itye ki miti iye, ci itwero camo ringo kit ma cwinyi mito. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Kace kabedo ma Rwot Lubangawu biyero me keto iye nyinge tye kamabor ki kama ityeni, ci itwero neko dyangi nyo romoni ma Rwot omiyo boti, macalo dong acikowu; itwero camo ki i gangi kit ma cwinyi mito. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Itwero camone kit ma kicamo ringo abur ki til; kadi wa dano ma kome ki keni twero camone kacel ki dano ma olonye. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">Lev 17:10-14</ref></char></note>Cung matek ilok man keken ni, pe icam remone, pien remo en aye kwo; pieno pe ibicamo kwo kacel ki ringone. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Pe ibicamo remo, ento ibionyo woko i ngom macalo pii. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Kace ibilubu cik man, ci nyimi bibedo leng, in kacel ki lutinoni ma bilubi. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Ento jamini maleng ducu ma myero imii, ki gityer me cobo kwong, ibikwanyo icito kwede ikabedo ma Rwot biyero. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Ibityero gitum awangani ducu, ringone ki remone, iwi keno tyer pa Rwot Lubangani; remo me gitumi ducu kibionyo woko ikom keno tyer pa Rwot Lubangani, ento ringone ibicamo. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Wugwoke wek wulub lok magi ducu ma acikowu kwedeni, wek nyimwu obed leng nakanaka, wun ki likwayowu ma bilubuwu, kace wutiyo gin manen maber ki ma atir iwang Rwot Lubangawu.”<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Juk ikom woro jogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />“Ka Rwot Lubangawu dong otyeko lurok woko ki inyimwu ma wucito kacamo lobogini, ma dong wucamo lobogi, wubedo iye, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />myero wugwoke wek pe wumok i owic pi lubu kitgi, ikare ma dong kityekogi woko ki inyimwu. Dok pe wubed kapenyo lok ikom lubangagi, kun wuwaco ni, ‘Rok man yam giworo lubangagi ningning, wek wan bene waworgi kitmeno?’ <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Pe wubitimo kumeno ikom Rwot Lubangawu, pien gibedo katimo gin me kwer ducu ma Rwot dagi pi woro lwak lubangagi; giwango wa awobegi ki anyiragi ki mac macalo gitum me woro lubangagi.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:2">Nwo 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:18-19">Niy 22:18-19</ref></char>
    </note>Gin ducu ma acikowu kwede myero wugwoke kalubune; pe wubimedo wiye dok pe wubikwanyo mogo woko.”<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />“Kace lanebi mo onen ikinwu, nyo lalek lek mo miyowu lanyut nyo tango mo, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />kace lanyut nyo tango ma otito pireni otime kakare, ce en owaco ni, ‘Wek dong walub kor lubanga mukene’ (mayam pe wungeyo) ‘wek wacak worogi,’ <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />pe wuwiny dog lanebi nyo lalek meno. Pien nongo Rwot Lubangawu tye katemo cwinywu wek enge ka wumaro en ki cwinywu ducu ki tipuwu ducu. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Wulub kor Rwot Lubangawu kun wulworo en dok wugwoko cike ducu; wuwor doge, wutii bote kun wucung ikome matek. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Ento wubineko lanebi nyo lalek meno woko, pien opwonyo dano ki jemo ikom Rwot Lubangawu, mayam okwanyowu dok okokowu woko ki i ot me opii i lobo Ejipt, wek pe omii wuwek yo mayam Rwot Lubangawu ociko ni wulubi. Kitmeno miyo wubijwero gin marac woko ki ikinwu.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />Kace omeru mo ma wod pa meni, nyo wodi, nyo nyari, nyo dakoni kikome, nyo laremi ma imaro ki kwoni ducu, obiti imung kun waco boti ni, ‘Wek wacit ka woro lubanga mogo mukene,’ ma nongo in kikomi nyo kwariwu yam pe gungeyo, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />lubanga pa rok ma gurumuwu dyereni, kadi ma gitye kamacok kwedwu nyo gitye kamabor, nia i agiki lobo tung cel cito kwede i agikine tung cel, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />pe iye doge, pe iwiny loke, pe kica omaki ikome, pe imung loke; <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />ento ibineke woko. Cingi aye bikwongo poto ikome me neke, lacen cing lwak ducu bipoto ikome. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Ibicele ki got ineke woko, pien obedo kayenyo yo me kwanyi woko ki bot Rwot Lubangawu mayam okwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt, ki i ot me opii. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Ci jo Icrael ducu gibiwinyo pire, ci gibilworo, miyo pe gibinwoyo timo bal marac macalo meno ikinwu.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />Gwok nyo i gang mo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu me bedo iye wubiwinyo ni <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />jo mogo ma kitgi racu, ma gin jowu kikome, guywayo tam pa jo ma bedo i gang meno kun giwaco ni, ‘Wubin wacitu ka woro lubanga mukene,’ mayam pe wungeyo. <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />Ci omyero wupeny loke kun wuyenyo tere motmot; kace onen ni loke otime ada, ma kimokoni lok me kwer macalo meno otime ikinwu, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />ci wubineko jo ma gibedo i taun meno woko ki pala lucwan, wubijwerogi woko ducu liweng, jo ducu matye iye, ki lim makwo bene matye iye, myero gutum woko ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Wubicoko jami ma wuyakoni ducu, wugurugi idyekal kamaleng, ci wubiwango taun meno ki jami ducu matye iye woko ki mac, obed gitum ma kiwango ducu ki bere bot Rwot Lubangawu. Taun meno bibedo wi odur matwal; pe dok kibigerone odoco. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Gin mo ma kidyero bot Rwot pe wubiweko dong i cingwu, wek Rwot okwany kinigane mager tutwali woko. En bitimowu kica kun nyutu cwiny me kica ikomwu, ci miyo wunya mapol kit mayam okwongo kwede bot kwariwuni, <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />kace wuworo dog Rwot Lubangawu, wumako cike ducu ma acikowu kwede tini dok wutiyo gin manen atir i wange.”<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s1">Kigengo jo Icrael kalubu kit kwero cola pa lurok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:28">Lev 19:28</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 21:5">21:5</ref></char>
    </note>“Wun aye lutino pa Rwot Lubangawu. Pe wubingolo komwu kenwu nyo lyelo tur nyimwu pi kwero cola. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Nia 19:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Nwo 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:18">26:18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref></char></note>Pien wun aye jo maleng pa Rwot Lubangawu; en Rwot aye yam oyerowu ki ikin rok ducu matye iwi lobo wek wubed jone kikome.”<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lee ma kicamo ki ma kikwero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Lev 11:1-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />“Pe wubicamo gin mo me kwer. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Magi aye gin lee ma wutwero camogi: dyang, romo, dyel, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />til, abur, ruda, dyel me tim, jubi, pura, ki romo ma i godi. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Lee ducu ma obong tyen gi akara, ma kin tyen gi opoke aryo, ma nyamo omen ki ikin lee ducu wutwero camogi. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Ento lee ma nyamo omen nyo ma obong tyen gi akara ma pe wubicamo gin ene; kinaga, apwoyo ki oduka, gin ginyamo omen ento kin tyen gi pe akara; pimeno gibedo keni botwu. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Ki opego bene, pien kadi obong tyene akara ento pe nyamo omen, en bene bedo keni botwu. Pe wucam ringogi, pe wugud wa komgi ma oto bene.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />Magi aye wutwero camogi ki ikin gin ducu ma bedo i pii: gin ducu matye ki kinga ngegi ki pok komgi wutwero camogi; <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />ento gin ma pe ki kinga ngegi ki pok komgi pe wubicamogi, pien gibedo keni botwu.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />Wutwero camo winyo ma pe keni ducu, <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />ento magi aye pe wubicamogi: ocur, acut, koga, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />agoga, okwata ki kit kwayigi ducu; <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />agak ki kit kwayigi ducu; <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />udu, tepe, awewet, olwit ki kit kwayigi ducu; <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />tula matino ki tula madongo, lagweno kulu, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />kikung ki ocur madito ki alwinya, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />acebe ki ogoro ki kit kwayigi ducu; ki putput ki olik.<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Kwidi ducu ma bwomgi tye gibedo keni botwu; pe wubicamogi. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Gin ducu ma bwomgi tye ma pe keni, wutwero camogi.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:19">Nia 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:26">34:26</ref></char>
    </note>Pe wubicamo geng lee mo ma oto kene; wutwero miyo bot labedo mo ma bedo ikinwu, wek en aye ocam, nyo wutwero cato bot larok mo owil; pien wun aye rok maleng pa Rwot Lubangawu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Pe wuted ringo latin dyel ki cak pa mine.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako dul acel me apar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30-33">Lev 27:30-33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:21">Wel 18:21</ref></char>
    </note>Wubimiyo dul acel me apar me jami ma wuceko i poto, ma a i poto mwaka ki mwaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Dok wubicamo dul acel me apar me nganowu ki inyim Rwot Lubangawu ikabedo kama en biyero ci keto nyinge bedo iye, ki dul acel me apar me kongo bwinowu ki moowu, ki lutino kayo pa dyangiwu ki pa romi ki dyegiwu; wek wupwony lworo Rwot Lubangawu jwijwi. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Kace wutye kamabor tutwal mamiyo pe wutwero kelo dul acel me apar ikare ma Rwot omiyowu iye gummi, pien kabedo ma Rwot oyero me keto iye nyinge odoko bor kwedwu, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />ci wubicato woko wek wunong cente, ci wutweyo lim meno wucito kwede ikabedo ma Rwot Lubangawu oyeroni. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Wubitic ki lim meno pi kit gin ducu ma cwinywu mito, macalo me wilo twoni, nyo romo nyo kongo bwino nyo kongo makec, ki gin ducu ma cwinywu mito, ci wubicamo ki kunu ki yomcwiny inyim Rwot Lubangawu, in ki jo ma i odi ducu. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Dok pe wubitenyo Lulevi ma gitye i taunwu ata, pien pe kipoko ki gin dul lobo mo nyo gin mo me aleyagi kacel kwedwu.<verse eid="DEU 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />I agiki mwaka adekadek wubikelo iye dul acel me apar me gin ducu ma wuceko i mwakanu, ma wukano i taunwu madito. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Ci Lulevi ma pe ki dul lobo mo ma gileyo ikinwu, lubedo, lutino kic, ki mon to ma i taunwu ducu, gin ducu gibibino kacam kwedwu ci giyeng; wek Rwot Lubangawu omiwu gum ikom gin ducu ma cingwu tiyo.”<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s1">Cik me weko banya matwal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Lev 25:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />“I agiki mwaka abiroabiro wubiweko banya bot dano matwal. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Man aye kit me weko banya: lami banya biweko banya me lim matwal ki bot dano mayam omako banyaneni; pe bipido banya ma omiyo bot lawote matwal, pien dong kityeko tito ki dano pi weko banya matwal kit ma Rwot ocikoni. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Itwero pido larok ocul banyani; ento kwany cwinyi woko ikom banya ma Laicrael lawoti omako boti. <verse eid="DEU 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />Ento lacan mo pe dong bibedo ikinwu, pien Rwot bimiyowu gum i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu ni wucam me aleyawu matwal, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />kace wubiworo dog Rwot Lubangawu kun wugwoke wek wulub cike ducu ma acikowu kwede tin. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu gum kit mayam ocike kwede botwuni. Wubimiyo rok mapol mako banya botwu, ento wun pe wubimako banya mo; dok wubiloyo rok mapol, ento gin pe gibiloyowu<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 25:35">Lev 25:35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka tye dano mo ma lacan ikinwu, ikin omegiwu ma gitye i taun mo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu, pe cwinywu obed tek, pe ikwer miye kony ikom ominwu meno ma lacani. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Ento ikonye, imiye omak banya maromo cobo gin ma en mito ducu, kadi bed gin ango.<verse eid="DEU 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Ber igwoke wek tam marac mo pe obed i cwinyi mamiyo iwaco ni, ‘Mwaka me abiro, ma en aye mwaka me weko banya matwal, dong cok,’ ci wangi cido woko ikom omeru ma lacani miyo pe dong imiye gin mo. Meno miyo en cako kok ikomi inyim Rwot, ci doko bal ikomi. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Ka imiye gin mo, ber imiye ma cwinyi leng matwal, cwinyi pe owang pi gin ma imiyeni, pien Rwot Lubangani bimiyowu gum ikom tic ducu ma itiyo, ki ikom tic cingi ducu. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:11">Mat 26:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:7">Mar 14:7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:8">Jon 12:8</ref></char></note>Lucan pe gibitum woko i lobowu, ma omiyo acikowu ni, wubiyabo cingwu malac bot omegiwu ki jo ma piny oloyogi, ki bot lucan ma i lobowu.”<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit me tic ki opii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 21:1-11">Nia 21:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 25:39-46">Lev 25:39-46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Kace kicato omeru mo boti, laco ma Laibru nyo dako ma Laibru, ci i wilo obed opiini nyo angecani, en bitiyo tic boti pi mwaka abicel. I mwaka me abirone ibiweko en a woko ki boti cito gire ki kuc. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Ka igonye wek ociti, pe ibiweko en cito ki cinge nono. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Ibimiyo en cito ki jami mapolpol, romi ki dyegi, bel ki kongo bwino, malubu kit ma Rwot Lubangani omiyi kwede gum. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Po ni yam ibedo opii i lobo Ejipt, kama Rwot Lubangani okoki ki iye; en gin ma omiyo tin aciki kumeno. <verse eid="DEU 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />Ento ka en owaco ni, ‘An pe abia woko ki boti,’ pien en mari ki jo ma i odi ducu, pien obedo kwedwu maber, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />ci ibikwanyo atero, ibitucu ki ite i dogola, ci dong bibedo opiini matwal. Ki angecani bene ibitimo kitmeno. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Pe ibitamo ni tek tutwal me weke a woko ki boti, pien obedo katic boti pi mwaka abicel kulu kun tice dodo tic pa lapakaca kiryo pi wel manok mo. Ka itimo kitmeno, Rwot Lubangani bimiyi gum i tic ducu ma itiyo.”<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwero lutino kayo me lim makwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 13:12">Nia 13:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Lutino kayo ducu ma kinywalogi ikin dyangini nyo romi ki dyegini ibikwero komgi inyim Rwot Lubangani. Pe ibitiyo tic mo ki lutino kayo pa dyangini, pe ibingolo yer kom lutino, kayo pa romini. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Ibicamo ringone kacel ki jo ma i odi, inyim Rwot Lubangani mwaka ki mwaka ki ikabedo ma Rwot biyero. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Ento ka kome kimwonyo, katyene ongol, nyo wange oto, nyo tye ki kit mwonyo mo marac ikome, pe ibitumu bot Rwot Lubangani. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Wubicamo ki igangwu ki kunu; dano ma kome ki keni twero camo kacel ki dano ma olony, macalo ringo abur ki til. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Aca 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lev 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Nwo 12:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23">23</ref></char></note>Remone keken aye pe wubicamo; wubionyo woko piny i ngom macalo pii.”<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s1">Karama me Kato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Nia 12:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:5-8">Lev 23:5-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Wel 28:16-25</ref></char>
    </note>“Wugwok dwe me Abib, wukwer iye nino madit me Karama me Kato pi woro Rwot Lubangawu, pien i dwe me Abib yam Rwot Lubangawu okwanyowu iye woko ki i Ejipt i dyewor. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Wubikwanyo gitum me Karama me Kato ki ikin romiwu nyo ikin dyangiwu, wutumu bot Rwot ikabedo ma en biyero, kama en biketo nyinge bedo iye. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Pe wubicamo mugati ma kirubu iye tobi; ento wubicamo Mugati ma Tobi Pe iye pi nino abiro pi po pi atwom mayam wubedo kwede; pien yam wua ki i lobo Ejipt rucurucu; ma omiyo ibipo pi nino mayam wua kwede ki i lobo Ejipt pi kare me kwowu ducu. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Tobi mo pe myero onen botwu i lobowu ducu pi nino abiro; kadi wa ringo mo ma ityero me gitum wi otyeno inino mukwongone pe bidong nio wa odiko. <verse eid="DEU 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />Pe wubityero gitum me Karama me Kato ki i gang mo ma ikin gangiwu ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu; <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />ento wubityero ki ikabedo ma Rwot Lubangawu biyero, kama en biketo nyinge bedo iye. Wubityero gitum me Kato kunu wi otyeno ma ceng cito ka potoni, icawa mayam wua kwede ki i Ejipt. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Wubitedo ci wubicamo i kabedo ma Rwot Lubangawu biyero; ci odiko wubia wudok ikemawu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Wubicamo Mugati ma Tobi Pe iye pi nino abicel; ikom nino me abirone wubibedo iye ki coke madit pi woro Rwot Lubangawu; pe wubitiyo iye tic mo.”<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nino madit me kwero kac</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:22">Nia 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lev 23:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Wel 28:26-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Wubikwano cabit abiro cake ki ikare ma wukwongo keto iye pala kac i ngut ngano mucung i poto. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Ka dok wubibedo ki nino madit me kwero Karama me Kac inyim Rwot Lubangawu kun wumiyo gityer ma iwu opwoyo; wubimiyo ma oporo gum ma Rwot Lubangawu omiyowu. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Ibibedo ki yomcwiny inyim Rwot Lubangawu, in ki lutinoni, opiini, angecani, Lulevi ma gibedo igangwu, ki lubedo, lutino kic ki mon to matye ikinwu, ki ikabedo ma Rwot Lubangawu biyero, kama en biketo iye nyinge bedo iye. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Wupo ni yam wubedo opii i Ejipt, ci wubigwoko cik magi ducu matek.”<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nino madito me Bolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Lev 23:33-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 29:12-38">Wel 29:12-38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Wubikwero nino madito me Bolo pi nino abiro, ikare ma dong wukayo cam ducu wudino woko wutero paco, kacel ki pig olok ma dong wupwono wubiyo woko. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Wubibedo ki yomcwiny ka wukwero nino maditoni, in ki lutinoni, opiini, angecani, kacel ki Lulevi ki lubedo, lutino kic ki mon to ma gibedo i taunwu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Wubikwero kare man pi nino abiro inyim Rwot Lubangawu ki i kabedo ma en biyero; pien Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu gum i cam ducu ma wuceko ki ikom tic me cingwu ducu, mamiyo wubibedo ki yomcwiny keken.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />Co ducu ma ikinwu myero gubin inyim Rwot Lubangawu tyen adek i mwaka acel acel ki i kabedo ma en biyero: inino madito me Mugati ma Tobi pe iye, inino madit me kwero cabit abiro, ki inino madito me Bolo. Pe gubin inyim Rwot ki cinggi nono; <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />dano acel acel bimiyo mot macalo en twero ma oporo kit gum ma Rwot Lubangawu omiye.”<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tic pa lungolkop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />“Wubiketo lungolkop ki ludito i taunwu ducu ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu, ma oporo kakawu; gin omyero gungol kop ma atir ki lwak. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:6-8">Nia 23:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lev 19:15</ref></char></note>Pe wubal te pido pa dano ma loke tye atir; pe wuket apokapoka mo ikin dano; pe wuye ki wilwu ki lim mo, pien wilo dano ki lim miyo laryeko doko lawange oto ci balo te pido pa jo ma lokgi tye atir woko. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Wungol kop atir keken, wek wubed makwo, wek wule lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu.”<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woro lubanga mukene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:13">Nia 34:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Ikare ma wubicano keno tyer pi Rwot Lubangawu, pe wubipito yat mo pi woro jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lev 26:1</ref></char></note>Dok pe wubicibo wir got mo cung me awora; meno aye gin ma Rwot Lubangawu okwero matek.”<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />“Pe wubitumu bot Rwot Lubangawu twon nyo romo nyo dyel mo ma kome kimwonyo, nyo matye ki kit ngolo mo, pien meno aye bedo me kwer bot Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />Gwok nyo kibinongo dano mo i taunwu mo i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu, laco nyo dako, ma otimo gin manen marac iwang Rwot Lubangawu pi turu gicikene, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:20">Nia 22:20</ref></char></note>ce ocito ka woro lwak lubanga mukene, nyo ceng nyo dwe nyo gin mo ma ikin mony me polo ce oryebe piny inyimgi, ma en aye gin maturu gicike matye i Cik apar ma Rwot ociko ni pe omyero kitim. <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />Ka dong kitito loke botwu ci wubikwedo loke maber. Kace loke tye ada ma ngene atir ni gin me kwer macalo meno otime i Icrael, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />ci wubikelo laco meno nyo dako meno ma otimo bal maraci i dog gang, ci wubicelo ki got wuneko woko. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:30">Wel 35:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">Nwo 19:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:1">2 Kor 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:19">1 Tem 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:28">Ibru 10:28</ref></char></note>Dano meno kibineko pi lok pa lucaden aryo nyo adek; dano mo pe kibineko pi lok pa lacaden acel keken. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:13">1 Kor 5:13</ref></char></note>Dok cing lucaden aye bikwongo poto ikom dano meno me neke, ka lacen cing lwak bipoto ikome. Kitmeno miyo wubijwero gin marac woko ki ikinwu.”<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pido inyim ajwaki ki lungolkop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />“Kace pido mo onen ikinwu ma ngolone oloyowu, macalo poko kin kit nek mapatpat, nyo lok kom twer ma dano moni tye kwede inyim cik, nyo lok kom ret ma dano mo oketo ikom lawote, kit pido mo matwero nen i taunwu ma ngolone tek loyowu, ci wubia wucito i kabedo ma Rwot Lubangawu oyeroni. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Wubicito bot ajwaki ma Lulevi, ki bot langolkop matye katic ikare meno, wubipenyogi ci gibititowu kit ngole. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Wubilubu kit ma kitito botwu i kabedo ma Rwot biyero; wubigwoke wek wutii kit gin ducu ma kicikowu kwede. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Wubitiyo kun wulubu kit cik ducu ma kipwonyowu kwede, ma oporo kit ngol ma gin gungolo. Pe wubikwero lubu lok ma gin gungolo, ento wubilubu kun pe wungak woko tung acuc nyo tung acam. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Dano ma lanywar ma okwero woro dog ajwaka ma ocung katic inyim Rwot Lubangawu, nyo dog langolkop kibineke woko; kitmeno miyo wubijwero gin marac woko ki ikinwu. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Lwak ducu gibiwinyo pire, ci miyogi lworo, miyo ngat mo pe dok bitimo tim anywar macalo meno.”<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako kom rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Cam 8:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Ka dong wuo i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu, ma dong wucamo wubedo iye, gwok nyo wubiwaco ni, ‘Waket rwot me loyowa, kit ma rok ducu ma gurumuwa tye kwedeni.’ <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />Dong ka wuketo rwot ma loyowu myero wunen ni obedo dano ma Rwot Lubangawu oyero. Myero obed ngat mo ikin utmegiwu; pe wuket larok olowu ma pe rokwu kikome. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:28">1 Luk 10:28</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:16">2 Tek 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:28">9:28</ref></char></note>En pe obed kacoko lwak aguragura pire kene, pe omii lwak odok cen i Ejipt pi wilo aguragura, pien Rwot yam owaco botwu ni, ‘Pe wubidok cen kunu matwal.’ <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:14-22:27">1 Luk 10:14—22:27</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:1-8">11:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:15">2 Tek 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:27">9:27</ref></char></note>Pe onyom mon mapol, miyo ngako cwinye woko; pe bene ocok lonyo madwong pire kene.<verse eid="DEU 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Ka dong obedo iwi komkere, ci bicoyo lok me cik man ducu i buk kun kwanyo loke ki i buk ma ajwaki ma Lulevi gwokoni. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />En bibedo kwede ci bedo kakwanone pi kare me kwone ducu, wek opwony lworo Rwot Lubangane pi gwoko lok ducu matye i cik man ki lubu gin ducu ma Rwot ociko, <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />wek pe obed kawake i cwinye ni edit ekato omegine, dok pe ongak owek cik woko, pe omyero otur cik pa Lubanga i yo mo keken, wek omede kibedo i kere nakanaka, en kacel ki likwaye i Icrael.”<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s1">Wang wat pa ajwaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />“Ajwaki ma Lulevi, wa kaka pa jo Levi ducu, pe gibilimo dul lobo mo nyo ginaleya mo ikin jo Icrael. Gin bicamo gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot ki gin ducu ma myero dano gumii bot Rwot. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:20">Wel 18:20</ref></char></note>Gin pe bileyo dul lobo mo ikin utmegigi, pien Rwot aye ginaleyagi kit mayam ocikogi kwede. <verse eid="DEU 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />Man aye bibedo wang wat pa ajwaki ma lwak bimiyo botgi: jo ma gityero gitum, kadi bibedo twon nyo romo, gibimiyo ringo bat bot ajwaka, ki cwake aryo ki apika. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Ngano ki kongo bwino ki moo mewu me wi mwaka, ki yer romo ma kikwongo nyarone, wubimiyo bot ajwaka. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Pien Rwot Lubangawu yam oyero jo Levi ki ikin kakawu ducu wek gucung katic inyim Rwot, gin ki likwayogi matwal.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />Kace Lalevi mo oa ki i taunwu mo ma i lobo Icrael ducu, kama yam en bedo iye, ci bino i kabedo ma Rwot biyero, en twero bino kit ma cwinye mito, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />ci bitic i nying Rwot Lubangane macalo Lulevi luwote ducu ma gicung katic kunu inyim Rwot. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />En binongo wang wat me acamane ducu marom ki luwote, medo ki lim ma en nongo ki i jami pa kwarone ma kicato.”<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ma juku lubu kit tim pa lurok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />“Ka dong wuo i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu, pe wubipwonyo lubu kit tim me kwer pa lurok ma kunu. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:26">Lev 19:26</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22:18">Nia 22:18</ref></char></note>Pe kinong ngat mo ikinwu ma owango wode nyo nyare me gityer, nyo dano mo ma odoko latyet, nyo latyet ki ajaa, langii i dyel, latal, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:31">Lev 19:31</ref></char></note>lakot piny, lakor tipu, min jok nyo lapeny dog tipu pa lato. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Ka dano mo timo gin ma kitmeno ci en bedo me kwer bot Rwot; pien pi timo gin me kwer ma kitmeno aye omiyo Rwot Lubangawu tye karyemo rok magi ducu woko ki inyimwu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mat 5:48</ref></char></note>Wun omyero wulub lok pa Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="DEU 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Rok magi ducu ma wubicamo lobogini giwinyo dog lutyet ki ajaa ki lutyet mukene ducu, ento wun aye Rwot Lubangawu pe ye ni wutim kitmeno.”<verse eid="DEU 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ociko pi cwalo lanebi macalo Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 3:22">Tic 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:37">7:37</ref></char>
    </note>“Rwot Lubangawu bicwalo lanebi mo macalo an, ma a ki ikin utmegiwu; wubiwinyo en. <verse eid="DEU 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />Inino mayam wucoke iye i Koreb wubako dogwu bot Rwot Lubangawu kun wuwaco ni, ‘Pe omyero wawinyo dwon Rwot Lubangawa, nyo neno kom mac maditi, wek pe wato.’ <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Ci Rwot owaco bota ni, ‘Gin ma gulokoni ducu guloko maber. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Abicwalo botgi lanebi mo macalo in ma oa ki ikin utmegigi. Abiketo lok ma mera idoge, ci en biwaco bot lwak lok ducu ma abicike kwede. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:23">Tic 3:23</ref></char></note>Kace dano mo okwero winyo loka ma en biwacone i nyinga, ci an aye abipenyo dog danoni wek aket can ikome. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Ento ka lanebi mo ocore ki wiye kawaco lok mo i nyinga ma onongo pe an aye acike ni oloki, nyo maloko i nying lubanga mukene, ci omyero wunek lanebi meno woko.’ <verse eid="DEU 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />Kace i loko ki i cwinyi ni, ‘Wabingeyo lok ma Rwot pe owaco ningning mono?’ <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Ci agamo kit man ni, ‘Kace lanebi mo oloko i nying Rwot ce lokenu pe otime nyo pe obedo me ada, meno nyutu ni loke pe Rwot aye owaco.’ Lanebi meno ocore ki wiye kene ki loke gire, pieno pe myero wubed kalwore.”<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s1">Taun madito me laro kwo pa lunek dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-28">Wel 35:9-28</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Yoc 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />“Ikare ma Rwot Lubangawu dong otyeko lurok woko ma en bimiyo lobogi botwu, ma dong wucamo lobogi ci wubedo i taun gi ki i odigi ducu, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />ci wubipoko taun adek woko pat i lobo ma Rwot Lubanga dong omiyowu me bedo mewu. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Wubipimo lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu ci wubipoko i dul adek kun dul acel acel bedo ki taune macok kwede wek okony ngat ma oneko dano me ringo iye wek olar iye kome.<verse eid="DEU 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Man aye lok me konyo kom lanek dano. Ka dano mo pe oneko lawote akaka, mayam mone mo onongo peke ikin gi, myero en oring kunu wek olar kome. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Labolle, ka dano mo ocito i bunga ki lawote mo ka tongo yen, ce otingo latong me tongo yen, ce latong oput woko ki i pure, ci ocelo lawote oneko woko, en omyero oring olar kome i taun mo acel ma ikin taun madito meno. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Ka pe kumeno, ce kiniga olyeti ikom lacul kwor remo miyo biryemo kor lanek, mako woko i yo, pien nongo piny bor, ci cobo neko woko. Ento dano macalo meno pe romo aneka, pien pe onongo mone mo tye ikin gi ikare macon, <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />en gin ma omiyo acikowu pi poko taun madito adek pat. <verse eid="DEU 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />Ikare ma Rwot Lubangawu oyabo wang lobowu omedo malac kit mayam okwongo kwede bot kwarowu, ma dong ominiwu lobo ducu mayam ociko ni ebimiyo bot kwariwu, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />dok kace wubigwoko cik man ducu ma acikowu kwede tin, ni wumar Rwot Lubangawu, wulub yone ducu ikare ducu, ci dok wubimedo taun madito mukene adek ikom maca. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Kitmeno pe kibionyo remo pa dano mo ma pe ki bal i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu me aleyawu, ci miyo alii me to pe bedo iwiwu.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />Ento ka dano mo iye dag lawote, ce obutu okure i yo, ci olwenyo ikome, ocobo omedo ki neko woko, ka laco meno oringo olaro i taun mo ikin taun madito adeki, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />ci ludongo me tung pa laneki gibicwalo dano giome ki kunu, kimiye i cing lacul kwor remo, wek kineke woko. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Kica pe bimakowu ikome, ento myero wulwok alii me to pa dano ma pe ki bal woko ki i Icrael kitmeno, wek ariya mo obed pe inyimwu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wang lobo ma ludongo gupoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:17">Nwo 27:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pe ibikobo got ma poko wang lobo pa lawoti mayam ludongo gutyeko pokone ki i lobo ma ibileyo bot kwarowu i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu me bedo mewu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako lucaden</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 35:30">Wel 35:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:6">Nwo 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:17">Jon 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:1">2 Kor 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:19">1 Tem 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:28">Ibru 10:28</ref></char>
    </note>“Lacaden acel pe miyo pido loyo dano mo pi kit bal mo nyo kit tim marac mo ma onongo otimo; ento kop biloyo dano pi lok pa lucaden aryo nyo adek. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Kace lacaden ma lagoba odoto dano moni ma otimo bal, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />ci gin lupido aryo ducu gibicito inyim Rwot, ki inyim ajwaki pa Lubanga ki lungolkop ma gitye i dog tic ikare meno. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Lungolkop bipenyo loke mot. Kace lacaden ma lagoba otongo adot ikom omine <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />ci kibiketo can ikome marom ki can ma nene en mito ni kiket ikom omineni. Kitmeno miyo wubijwero tim marac woko ki ikinwu. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Miyo jo mukene gibiwinyone ci gibilworo, miyo ngat mo pe dok bitimo tim marac macalo meno. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:23-25">Nia 21:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:19-20">Lev 24:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:38">Mat 5:38</ref></char></note>Kica pe bimakowu ikome; kwo kibiculu ki kwo, wang ki wang, lak ki lak, bad ki bad, tyen ki tyen.”<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako mony</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />“Ikare ma wubicito ka monyo lumerokwu, kace wuneno gin tye ki lwak aguragura ki gadigadi lweny, dok monygi bene dit makato mewu, pe wubed ki lworo ikomgi, pien Rwot Lubangawu bibedo kwedwu, en mayam okwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Ka dong wurwayo cok kalweny, ci ajwaka pa Lubanga bikato anyim kalok ki buca monywu. <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />En biwaco botgi ni, ‘Wun jo Icrael wuwiny, tin dong wurwayo cok kalweny ikom lumerokwu. Cwinywu pe oryange, pe wulwor, komwu pe omyel, atiba pe omakwu ikomgi; <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />pien Rwot Lubangawu aye bicito kwedwu kalweny pirwu ikom lumerokwu ci bimiyo wuloyogi.’<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />Lacen ludito mony gibilok ki dano kun giwaco ni, ‘Tye laco mo kany ma ogero ode ci peya okwero me donyo iye? Wek en odok cen paco, wek pe oto i lweny ci miyo dano mukene aye dok bikwero ode. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Tye laco mo kany ma opito poto oloke ci peya ocamo nyige? Wek en odok paco, wek pe oto i lweny ci miyo ngat mukene aye camo nyig oloke. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Tye laco mo kany ma otongo keny ikom dako ci peya obedo kwede? Wek en odok paco, wek pe oto i lweny ci miyo laco mukene aye bedo ki dakone.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Ludito mony dok gibimede ki lokgi bot lwak kun giwaco ni, ‘Tye laco mo kany ma lalworo ma kome oryange woko? Wek en odok woko paco, pien bimiyo jo mukene cwinygi ryange woko macalo en.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Ka dong ludito gutyeko lokgi bot lwak, ci dong gibiyero lutel wi mony.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />Ikare ma wurwayo cok kalweny ikom taun madit mo, kong wumii ki jo ma iye kare me mine ken gi botwu ka gimito kuc wek pe wulweny ikomgi. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Ka jo me taun madit meno guyabo dog celgi botwu, ce gumine botwu ken gi ki kuc, ci jo ducu ma binonge iye wubidiyogi ki tic wek gubed macalo opiiwu. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Ento ka gukwero jolo lokwu me kuc, ce gucako lweny ikomwu, ci monywu birumu taun meno ci wubituru celgi woko. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />Ka Rwot Lubangawu omiyogi i cingwu, ci wubineko co ducu ki pala lucwan, <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />ento mon ki lutino matino ducu ki limgi makwo, ki jami ma i taungu ducu bibedo me ayakawu, wubiyako wuterogi bedo mewu, ci wutwero tic ki jami ma wuyako ki bot lumerokwu, ma Rwot Lubangawu omiyo botwu. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Wubitimo taun madito ducu matye kamabor kwedwu kitmeno, ento pe wubitimo man ikom taun madito pa lurok ma gibedo cok kwedwu.<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />Ento taun madito pa rok magi ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyo lobogi botwu me bedo mewuni, pe wubiweko gin mo dong iye makwo. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Wubijwerogi woko ducu liweng, gin aye jo Kit, jo Amor, jo Kanaan, jo Periji, jo Kiv ki jo Jebuc, macalo Rwot Lubangawu yam ocikowu kwede. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Wek gin pe gubed ka pwonyowu ki timo gin me kwer ma gitimo me woro lwak lubangagi, ma bimiyo wupoto i bal inyim Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />Kace wurumu taun madit mo pi kare malac, kun wulwenyo ikome me makone, pe wubitongo yadi ma ingete woko ducu ki latongwu. Wutwero camo nyiggi ento pe wutong yadi wuret woko piny. Yadi bene ma gitye i lum gudoko dano bo wek monywu orumgi olweny ikomgi? <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Ento yadi ma wungeyoni pe kicamo nyiggi aye wubityekogi woko kun wutongogi wuretogi woko piny wek wuger ki cel matek me lweny ikom gang matye kalweny i komwuni, nio ka opoto i cingwu.”<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s1">Kace pe kingeyo lanek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />“Kace kinongo dano mo kineko i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu me bedo mewu, kun kome obutu i tim ata, ci pe kingeyo ngat ma oneke, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />ci ludongowu ki lungolkopwu gibibino kunu, gibiporo bor piny nio wa i taun ma orumu kom dano ma kinekoni. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Ludongo ma i taun macok ki kom dano ma kinekoni gibikelo roya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I lobo Acoli kitiyo ki twon me pur ento pe kitiyo ki roya.</char></note> ma peya otiyo tic mo, ma peya oywayo kweri dyang. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Kibitero royani wa i nota kulu mo ma piine mol kare ducu, i kabedo mo kama yam peya kipuru, ma pe kicoyo iye kodi, kibituru ngut roya woko ki i nota kunu; <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />ci ajwaki ma gin likwayo pa Levi gibinyiko cok, pien yam Rwot Lubangawu oyerogi pi tic bote ki me lamo gum i nying Rwot, gin bene myero gutyek lok ducu me pido ki me bwami. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Ludongo me taun meno macok adada ki kama kinongo iye kom dano ma kinekoni gibilwoko cinggi malo iwi kom roya ma kituru ngute i notani, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />ci gilamo doggi kun giwaco ni, ‘Cingwa pe ooyo remo pa dano man, wangwa bene pe oneno ka kineke. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Ai Rwot, tim kica ki jo Icrael ma gin aye joni mayam ikokogini, pe iket alii me remo pa dano man ma pe ki bali i dye lwaki Icrael, ento itimgi kica pi bal me to man.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Kace wutiyo meno, ci nongo wutiyo gin ma Rwot mito, ci nongo wulwoko alii me remo woko ki ikinwu kitmeno.”<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mon ma kimakogi ilweny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />Moses owaco bot jo Icrael ni, “Ka wucito kalweny ikom lumerokwu, ce Rwot Lubangawu omiyogi i cingwu ci wuyakogi wuterogi me bedo jo alimawu, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />gwok nyo ngat acel ki ikinwu bineno dako mo mamwonya ikin jo ma wuyakoni ci cwinye mare matek kun mitoni ekwanye wek odok dakone. <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />Ka tye kumeno ci en bitere paco wa i ode. Ka dong bilyelo yer wi dako meno, ngolo lwete, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />ci bilunyu bongone woko ma omake kwede me bedo opiini, ci biruke mukene; ci dakonu bibedo i ode kun koko wone ki mine dwe acel kulu, ka lacen twero bedo kwede macalo cware, ci en dong bibedo dakone. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Ka inen cwinye oari woko ki ikome, ci biweko dakonu cito gire mot kama en bimito; ento pe bicate pi lim macalo angeca, pien nongo dong otyeko lanye woko.”<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lim aleya pa latin kayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />“Kace laco mo tye ki mon aryo, kun nongo cwinye maro dako acel makato mukene ca, ce mon aryoni ducu gunywalo lutino co, ka latin kayo obedo wod pa dako ma pe cwinye maro tutwali, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />ci ikare ma laconi poko lim me aleya ki awobene, en pe omii bot latin kayo pa dako ma cwinye maroni dul lim ma oporo dit pa latin kayo ma ka miyo bot latin kayone kikome ma wod pa dako ma pe cwinye maro tutwali. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Ento en bitucu ni latin kayo en aye pa dako ma pe cwinye maro tutwali, ci bimiye lim ma dodo dul aryo ma ikom jamine ducu ma en tye kwede. Pien en aye acaki kero kome, dit me bedo latin kayo aye mere gire.”<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awobi ma lajemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />“Ka dano mo tye ki wode ma ngute nwang dok lajemo, ma pe winyo dog wone ki mine, kadi bed kijuye matek ento pe winyogi, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />ci wone ki mine gibimake gitere wa i dog gang bot ludongo me taun meno ma en bedo iyeni. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Ci gibiwaco bot ludongo ma i ganggi ni, ‘Latin awobiwa man ngute nwang dok lajemo, pe winyo dogwa, en lacarcar dok lamero kongo matek.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Ci dano ducu me taun meno gibicele woko ki got nio ka oto. Kitmeno miyo wubijwero gin marac woko ki ikinwu. Jo Icrael ducu gibiwinyo ci miyo gilworo.”<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik mogo mapatpat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />“Ka dano mo otimo bal marome nongo can me to ci kineke woko, ma kingabe malo iwi yat, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />ci pe kibiweko kome bedo iwi yat dyewor. Wubiyiko kome inino meno kikome, pien dano ma kingabo iwi yat bedo dano ma Lubanga oceno; pe wubinyobo lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu me aleyawu.”<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:4-5">Nia 23:4-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Ka ineno dyang nyo romo pa Laicrael lawoti ma orwenyo woko ata, ci pe ikwer miyo kony; dwok cen bote. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Kace en pe bedo cok kwedi, nyo ka pe ingeye, ibitero leenu paco ci bibedo boti nio ka wone oyenyo, ka dong ibidwokone bote. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Kanane bene ibitimo kitmeno, ki bongone nyo kit jami mo keken pa Laicrael lawoti ma orwenyo ki bote ma in inongo; pe ikwer miyo kony.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />Ka inongo kana pa Laicrael lawoti nyo dyange ma opoto piny inget yoo, pe inen anena; konye ki ilone malo.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />Dako pe oruk ginaruka pa co, dok laco bene pe oruk ruk pa mon, pien dano ma otimo kumeno bedo me kwer bot Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />Kace icob ikom ot winyo mo matye iwi yat nyo piny i ngom, ma lutino tye iye, nyo tonge, ki mine bene oumu wi lutinone nyo obutu iwi tonge, pe ibimako mine kacel ki lutinone. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Ibiweko mine tuk cito, ento ibicoko lutino icito kwede, wek ariya mo pe onen inyimi ento ibed kwo pi kare malac.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />Kace igero ot manyen, ibigoyo wi ot meri irumu woko ki lageng, wek pe ikel bal me oyo remo i odi, ma nongo ngat mo obut opoto piny ki iwiye.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:19">Lev 19:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pe ibicoyo kit kodi mo mapat i poto ma ipito iye oloki, miyo pe ibikayo gin ducu ma cek iye dok pe ibibiyo nyig olok bene. <verse eid="DEU 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />Pe ibitweyo dyang ki kana kacel me puru potoni. <verse eid="DEU 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />Pe ibiruku bongo ma kicweyo ki uci yer romo kacel ki ma kicweyo ki uci camanini.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 15:37-41">Wel 15:37-41</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ibikwoyo jira angwen itwok bongo ma iume kwedeni.”<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako cot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />“Ka laco mo onyomo nyako ce obedo kwede, ka iye okwere woko, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />ci otongo doge ki lok me lewic ma obalo nying nyako woko marac kun waco ni, ‘Anyomo nyako man ci ka abutu kwede, ci pe anongo gin ma nyutu atir ni peya ocodo co.’ <verse eid="DEU 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />Won latin dakonu ki mine gibikelo bongo ma nyutu atir ni latin dakonu peya ocodo co bot ludongo ma i gang meno kama gicoke iye i dog gang. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />Ci won latin dakonu biwaco bot ludongo ni, ‘Amiyo nyara bot laco man ci onyomo ka dok okwero en woko. <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Ci nen, okelo lok me lewic ikome kun waco ni pe enongo gin ma nyutu atir ni nyara peya ocodo co. Kong wunen, man en aye gin ma nyutu atir ni nyara onongo peya ocodo co.’ Ci biyaro bongonu inyim ludongo ma i gang meno. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Ludongo gibitero laconu gigoyo, <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />gingole cul me cekel me ryal miya acel. Kibimiyo lime bot won nyako, pien laconu obalo nying nya jo Icrael ma peya ocodo co. Ci bibedo dakone, pe biryeme woko matwal pi kare me kwone ducu. <verse eid="DEU 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Ento ka loke ada ni, gin mo pe kinongo ma nyutu atir ni latin dakonu onongo peya ocodo co, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />ci jo ma i taun meno bicele ki got gineke woko, pien otimo gin ma pe myero i Icrael pi codo co ki i ot pa wone. Wubijwero tim marac woko ki ikinwu kitmeno.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />Ka kinongo laco mo ka butu ki dako pa laco mukene, gin aryo ducu kibinekogi woko, laco ma obutu ki dako, ki dako bene. Kitmeno miyo wubijwero gin marac woko ki ikinwu.<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />Ka tye nyako mo ma peya ongeyo laco, ma kitongo keny ikome ce laco mo oromo kwede i dye taun ka obutu kwede, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />ci wubitero gin aryo ducu woko i dog cel me taun meno, wucelogi ki got wunekogi woko, latin nyakonu bito pien pe ogoyo oduru kadi onongo tye i dye taun, dok laco bene bito pi mako dako pa lawote ki tek. Kitmeno miyo wubijwero tim marac woko ki ikinwu.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />Ento ka laco mo orwate ki nyako mo ma kitongo keny ikome i dye tim ce omake tektek obutu kwede, ci laco ma obutu kwedeni aye kibineko. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Pe wubitimo gin mo ikom nyako, pien en pe ki bal mo maromo keto can me to ikome. Lok man rom ki pa laco mo ma olwenyo ikom lawote ci oneke woko. <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />Pien laconu obino ikom nyakonu i dye tim ci kadi bed en ogoyo oduru onongo ngat mo peke kunu ma lare.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:16-17">Nia 22:16-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka laco mo orwate ki nyako mo ma peya kitongo keny ikome ce omake tektek obutu kwede, ka kimakogi, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />ci laco ma obutu kwedeni bimiyo lim me luk bot won nyako maromo cekel pyere abic, ci nyakonu bidoko dakone, pien omake ki tek; pe biryeme woko matwal pi kare me kwone ducu.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:8">Lev 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:11">20:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:20">Nwo 27:20</ref></char>
    </note>Laco mo pe obed ki ciwone, pe oket lewic ikom wone kitmeno.”<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s1">Jo ma kigengogi bedo i coke pa jo pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />“Dano ma kidino mane nyo ma kingolo kome me co woko pe bidonyo i coke pa jo pa Lubanga.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Latin luk pe bidonyo i coke pa jo pa Lubanga; kadi wa likwaye me apare, wa acel mo pe bidonyo i coke pa jo pa Lubanga.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 13:1-2">Nek 13:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dano mo pa jo Ammon nyo pa jo Moab pe bidonyo i coke pa jo pa Lubanga; kadi wa likwayogi me apare ngat acel mo ki ikomgi pe bidonyo i coke pa jo pa Lubanga matwal. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-6">Wel 22:1-6</ref></char></note>Pien gin yam gukwero jolowu ki kwon ki pii ikare ma wua woko ki i Ejipt, dok bene yam gukelo Balaam wod pa Beor ki i Petor ma i Mecopotamia ci guwilo en ki lim wek ocenwu. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:7-24:9">Wel 23:7—24:9</ref></char></note>Ento Rwot Lubangawu pe owinyo dog Balaam; oloko lok me cenowu odoko me kelo gum ikomwu, pien Rwot Lubangawu onongo marowu. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Pe wutim gin mo makelo ki gin kuc ki berbedo matwal, pi kare me kwo mewu ducu.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />Pe ii okwer Laedom mo, pien en omeru. Pe ii okwer Laejipt mo, pien yam in labedo i lobone. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Lutinogi ma kinywalogi ma likwayogi me adek gitwero donyo i coke pa jo pa Lubanga.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />Ka wucito kalweny ki lumerokwu, ma pud wutye i gony, myero wugwoke ikom gin maracu ducu.<verse eid="DEU 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Ka tye laco mo ikinwu ma odoko keni pi gin ma otime bote i dyewor, ci en bicito woko inge gony, bedo kunu. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Ento ka piny oyutu bilwoko kome ki pii, ci ka ceng opoto en twero dwogo i gony.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />Wubiyubu kabedo mo woko inge gony kama wubicito kakonye iye. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Wubed ki tir ikin jami lwenywu; ci ka i nyongo kakonye ibikwinyo bur ki tir, ka iloke iumu wi coron ma meri woko. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Pien Rwot Lubangawu woto limo dye gonywu pi larowu ki pi ryemo lumerokwu woko ki inyimwu, ma omiyo dye gonywu omyero obed maleng wek en pe onen gin mo ma keni ci miyo en loke wekowu woko.”<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik mapatpat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />“Pe ibidwoko opii mo bot rwode kace en oringo rwode olaro boti. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />En bibedo ikinwu i kabedo mo ma en oyero ki ikin taunwu, kama iye mito; pe wubiune.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:29">Lev 19:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kit me tim kwele me woro jogi obed peke ikin anyira Icrael, dok kit me tim kwele ki awobe mukene pi woro jogi obed peke ki ikin awobe Icrael. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Pe wubikelo lim ma kinongo pi tim kwele nyo pi tim caro macalo gwok i Ot pa Rwot Lubangawu macalo cul me cobo kwongwu mo; pien gin ducu jami me kipyeda inyim Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:25">Nia 22:25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:36-37">Lev 25:36-37</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:7-11">Nwo 15:7-11</ref></char>
    </note>Pe ibimiyo Laicrael lawoti mako banya boti me cente nyo me cam pi limo magoba, kadi banya me gin mo makelo magoba. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Itwero mako magoba ikom banya ma imiyo bot dano me rok mukene, ento pe ikom banya ma imiyo bot Laicrael lawoti. Ka ilubu cik man ci miyo Rwot Lubangawu bimiyi gum ikom gin ducu ma ibitiyo i lobo ma dong wucok donyo iye me camoneni.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 30:1-16">Wel 30:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mat 5:33</ref></char>
    </note>Ka ikwongo kwong mo bot Rwot Lubangani, pe ibed ka gale ki cobone; pien Rwot Lubangawu bipenyi pire ada, ci bibedo bal boti ka pe iculu. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Ka pe ikwongo kwong, bal mo pe boti. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Ento teke imiine ka kwongo kwong mo bot Rwot Lubangawu, myero igwoke mada kacobo lok ma okati ki i dogi.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />Ka iwok ki i dye poto olok pa lawoti, itwero camo nyige mabup macalo i mito, ento pe ibipiko mogo i kicaani. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Dok ka iwok ki i poto pa lawoti ma ngano ocung iye, itwero jako wite ki cingi me acamani, ento pe ibiketo pala kac i ngut ngano mucung i poto pa lawoti.”<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako nyom ki keto nyom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat 5:31</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:7">19:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mar 10:4</ref></char>
    </note>“Ka laco mo onongo dako ci onyomo, ce onongo roc mo ikom dakone makelo lewic. Ci twero coyo waraga me keto nyom, miyo i cinge, ryeme kwede woko ki i ode, ci dakoni a woko ki i ode. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Ka laco mukene onyome, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />ce dok bene pe mite, ci coyo waraga me keto nyom, miyo i cinge ci ryeme kwede woko ki i ode, nyo ka cware me aryone oto woko. <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />Ci cware mukwongo mayam oryeme woko ca pe dok binyome me bedo dakone; en myero onen dako meno calo gin me kwer inyim Rwot. Wun pe wubikelo bal ikom lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyo botwu me aleyawu.”<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik mukene mapatpat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />“Ka laco mo pud onyomo nyen, pe bicito woko kacel ki mony, dok pe kibicwale i dog tic mo; en bibedo paco mot pi mwaka acel, wek obed ki yomcwiny gin ki dakone ma onyomoni.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />Ka imiyo den bot ngat mo, pe omyero iwek omii boti min kidi regone nyo nya kidi regone me ajenga pi banyani matye bote; meno rom ki jengo kwo pa dano.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 21:16">Nia 21:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka kinongo ngat mo kakwalo dano mo ki ikin Laicrael lawote, me timo en kit ma kitimo ki opii, nyo me cate woko, ci lakwo meno kibinekone woko; kitmeno miyo wubijwero tim marac woko ki ikinwu.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 13:1-14:54">Lev 13:1—14:54</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Wubed kun wugwoke matek ikom two dobo kun wutimo gin ducu kit ma ajwaka ma Lalevi bitito ki wun; kit mayam acikogi kwede, wubigwoke katiyo kitmeno. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:10">Wel 12:10</ref></char></note>Wupo gin mayam Rwot Lubangawu otiyo ikom Miriam ki i yoo ma onongo wua ki i Ejipt.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:26-27">Nia 22:26-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka lawoti mo omako banya mo boti, pe ibicito i ode kaomo bongo ma en jengo boti. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />In ibicung ki woko, ci dano ma omako banya botini bikelo bongo ma ojengo boti ki woko. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Ka en dano ma lacan, pe ibibutu ki bongo ma en ojengo boti. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Ka ceng mito poto, in ibidwoko bongo ma ojengoni wek en obut ki bongone kun lamo ki in gum; ci bimiyo Rwot Lubangawu bineni macalo dano ma kite atir.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev 19:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pe ibiburu lapakacani mo ma lacan ma piny oloyo, kadi en bed omeru ma Laicrael nyo dano mo ma ikin lubedo ma gibedo i lobowu, i taunwu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Ibimiye mucarane inino ma otiyo iyeni ma nongo ceng peya opoto, pien en lacan, en bedo kaparo pire; wek en pe okok ikomi bot Rwot ci bedo bal ikomi.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:6">2 Luk 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 25:4">2 Tek 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:20">Eje 18:20</ref></char>
    </note>Pe kibineko won latin pi bal pa wode, nyo latin bene pe kibineko pi bal pa wone; dano acel acel kibineko pi bale kikome.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:9">Nia 23:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:33-34">Lev 19:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:19">Nwo 27:19</ref></char>
    </note>Pe ibal te pido pa labedo mo nyo pa latin kic wek lok oloye, pe iter bongo pa dato me ajenga boti. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Ento ibipo ni yam ibedo opii i lobo Ejipt ci Rwot Lubangawu okoki woko ki kunu, en gin ma omiyo aciko ni i tim kitmeno.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:9-10">Lev 19:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:22">23:22</ref></char>
    </note>Ka ikayo cam i potoni, ce wii owil ki larita ngano mo iweko odong i poto, pe idok cen ka omone; dong bibedo pi labedo ki latin kic ki dato; wek Rwot Lubangawu omii gum ikom tic ducu ma ibitiyo. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Kace igoyo yat jeitunini pi coko nyige, pe idok ibek obote; dong bibedo pa labedo ki latin kic ki dato. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Ka icoko nyig olok ki i potoni, pe idok cen ka beko obote; dong bibedo pa labedo ki latin kic ki dato. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Ibipo ni yam ibedo opii i lobo Ejipt, en gin ma omiyo aciko ni i tim kumeno.”<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />Ci Moses omede ki lok ni, “Ka laro kop mo tye ikin dano, ka gubino kama kipido iye, ce langolkop ongolo kop ikin gi kun kitucu dano ma pe ki bal, ka kingolo kop loyo latim bal, <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />ka dano ma labalo romo agoya, ci langolkop miyo en butu piny ci kigoye ki inyime ki wel odo muporo kit bale. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:24">2 Kor 11:24</ref></char></note>Wel odo twero bedo pyere angwen, ento pe okat kenyo, wek pe kigoye ki lwak goco makato meno miyo wucayo ominwu.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 9:9">1 Kor 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tem 5:18</ref></char>
    </note>Pe itwe dog twon ka tye ka nyono ngano me dinone.”<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lako dato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:24">Mat 22:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:19">Mar 12:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:28">Luk 20:28</ref></char>
    </note>“Kace omego aryo gibedo kacel ce ngat acel ikin gi oto woko ma pe ki wode mo, pe wubiye dano ma welo ma pe ladogolagi tero dako pa lato. Omin cware aye bilako dakonu. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Latin laco ma en binywalo bibedo ka wi omine, wek nying omine pe orweny woko ki i Icrael. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:7-8">Rut 4:7-8</ref></char></note>Ento ka omin latoni pe mito lako ciomine, ci ciomine bicito kama ludongo me taun gucoke iye ci waco ni, ‘Ywera okwero nywalo wi omine wek nyinge pe orweny woko ki ikin jo Icrael; en pe oye cobo tic pa ywero ikoma.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Ka ludongo ma i taun gi bilwongo laconu ci gibilok kwede. Kace en pud mede ki loke kun waco ni, ‘An pe amito lake,’ <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />ciomine bicito cok bote inyim ludongo ci lunyu war woko ki i tyene, ka ngulu laa i wange kun waco ni, ‘Laco ma okwero nywalo lutino ka wi omine kibitimo kitmeno.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Ki nying dogolane kibilwongo i Icrael ni, ‘Dogola pa dano ma kilunyu war woko ki ityene.’<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />Kace co gitye kalweny keken gi, ka dako pa ngat acel onyiko cok ka laro cware ki i cing dano matye ka goyeni, ce ocwalo cinge omako kom me co pa laconi, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />ci ibitongo cing dako ingunu woko, ma kica pe maki ikome.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:35-36">Lev 19:35-36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pe i tim aram me bedo ki kidi lapim jami aryo i kicaani, mapek ki mayote. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Pe i tim aram me bedo ki lapor jami aryo i odi, madite ki matidine. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Ibibedo ki kidi lapim pek pa jami maber maromo kakare, ki agwata lapor jami maber maromo kakare, wek irii pi kare malac i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Jo ducu ma gitimo gin macalo meno, ki jo ducu ma pe gitiyo gin matye atir, gibedo me kwer bot Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:8-14">Nia 17:8-14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:2-9">1 Cam 15:2-9</ref></char>
    </note>Wupo gin mayam jo Amalek gutimo ikomwu i yoo ikare ma wua woko ki i Ejipt, <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />kit mayam gulwenyo kwede ikomwu i yoo ca, ikare ma onongo wuder, ma komwu ducu oloc woko, kit ma gin gungolo kwede wi jo ma gudong i ngewu ma gi goro; gin yam pe gulworo Lubanga wa ki acel. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Kace Rwot Lubangawu dong omiyo wuywe ki lweny ki merokwu ducu ma orumuwu dyereni, ki i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyo wubicamo me aleyawu, ci wubijwayo jo Amalek woko ki i tam pa dano ducu ma gitye piny ite polo. Wiwu pe owil ilok man.”<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s1">Gityer ikare me kac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />“Ka dong wuo i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu me aleyawu, ma dong wucamo lobo wubedo iye, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Nia 23:19</ref></char></note> wubikwanyo dul mo ikom gin mukwongo cek ikom kit cam ducu ma wukayo ki i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu omiyowu, wubiketo i aduku wucito kwede i kabedo ma Rwot Lubangawu biyero kama biketo nyinge bedo iye. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Wubicito bot ajwaka pa Lubanga matye katic ikare meno, ci wubiwaco bote ni, ‘Tin atucu bot Rwot Lubangana ni atyeko o i lobo mayam Rwot okwongo pire bot kwariwa ni ebimiyo botwa.’ <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Ci ajwaka bigamo aduku ki i cingi, ci keto piny inyim keno tyer pa Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="DEU 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Ci ibidok iye ki inyim Rwot Lubangawu ni, ‘Kwarowa yam dano me lobo Aram, ma lamal gang ata. Yam olak ocito wa i Ejipt obedo kunu ma welgi nok mo; ki kunu en odoko rok madit ki matek ma onya mapol. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Jo Ejipt gubedo ka timowa magwa marac tutwal, ma giunuwa, guketowa i tic matego me opii. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Ka yam wakok bot Rwot Lubanga pa kwarowa, ci Rwot owinyo dogwa, oneno kit ma giunuwa kwede, ki aroma ticwa, ki atwomwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Rwot okwanyowa woko ki i Ejipt pi twero me bade, ki cinge ma oryeyo, ki tim ma okelo lworo madwong, ki lwak lanyut ki tango. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Okelowa wa i kabedo man, omiyowa loboni, en lobo ma miu ma ceko cam mapol. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Ci dong inen ka tin akelo wi mwaka ma oa i poto ma imiyo bota; ai Rwot.’ Ka dong iketo aduku piny inyim Rwot Lubangani, ci iryebe piny iwore. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Cwinyi bibedo yom pi jami mabeco ducu ma Rwot Lubangani omiyo boti ki bot jo me odi; ci ibimiyo Lulevi ki lubedo ma gibedo ikinwu bene cwinygi obed yom kacel kwedwu.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 14:28-29">Nwo 14:28-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>I mwaka me adeke, ma en aye mwaka me miyo dul acel ikom apar, ibimiyo dul acel me apar me kit cam ducu ma ocek i potoni bot Lulevi, lubedo, lutino kic ki mon to wek gin bene gubed ki cam ma romogi i taunwu ducu. Ka dong ityeko miyone botgi, <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />ci ibiwaco bot Rwot Lubangani ni meno, ‘Dong atyeko kobo jami maleng woko ki i oda, amiyo woko bot Lulevi, lubedo, lutino kic ki mon to kun alubu ciki ducu ma imiyo bota. Pe aturu ciki mo, pe bene wiya owil ikomgi. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Pe acamo gin mo ikom dul acel me apar ikare ma atye kakwero cola, pe akobo gin mo ki i oda ma onongo koma ki keni, pe atyero mogo bot tipu pa lato mo; dong aworo dogi, in Rwot Lubangana, atyeko tiyo gin ducu kit mayam icika kwede. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Nen piny ki i kabedoni malengi, nia ki i polo, ci imii gum ikom joni Icrael ki ikom lobo ma imiyowa kit mayam ikwongo kwede bot kwariwa, en lobo ma miu maceko cam mapol.’”<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Nia 34:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />“Tin Rwot Lubangawu ocikoni wulub cik magi ki gin ma en ongolo ducu, ma omiyo wubigwoke mada kalubugi ki cwinywu ducu ki tipuwu ducu. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Tin dong wutucu lok ikom Rwot ni en aye Lubangawu, dok ni wubilubu yone ducu kun wugwoko cike ki gin ma en ociko ducu, dok wubiworo doge. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Nia 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Nwo 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref></char></note>Dok tin Rwot otucu lok ikomwu ni wun aye wu jone kikome, <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />dok en bipilo wiwu makato rok ducu mayam en oketo; kibipake pirwu, nyinge biywek pirwu, en bilimo deyo ikomwu, dok otucuni wun wubibedo rok maleng pi Rwot Lubangawu, kit mayam owaconi.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s1">Cik pa Lubanga ma kigoro ikom got</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Ka Moses, kacel ki ludongo pa jo Icrael, ociko lwak kun waco botgi ni, “Wumak cik ducu ma acikowu kwede tin. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:30-32">Yoc 8:30-32</ref></char></note>Dok ikom nino ma wungolo iye kulu Jordan pi donyo i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu, wubicibo iye kidi madito ci wubimwono komgi ki lobo laim matar. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Wubicoyo lok me cik magi ducu ka wukato me donyo i lobo ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu, en aye lobo ma miu maceko cam mapol, kit ma Rwot, Lubanga pa kwariwu, yam ocikowu kwedeni. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Ka wungolo loka Jordan, wubicibo kidinu gicung ikom got Ebal, kit ma tin acikowu kwede, dok wubimwono komgi ki lobo laim matar. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:25">Nia 20:25</ref></char></note>Wubicano keno tyer kunu pi Rwot Lubangawu, keno tyer ma kicano ki got; pe kiting nyonyo mo me payo komgi. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Wubitic ki got ma pe kipayo komgi, en aye wubitumu gitum awanga iye bot Rwot Lubangawu, <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />ka dok wubityero iye gityer lakwecwiny ma wubicamone ki kunu, ci cwinywu bibedo yom inyim Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Wubicoyo lok me cik man ducu ikom kidi ma wubicibogi kunu maber ma kwanone yot.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Moses ki ajwaki ma Lulevi guwaco ki jo Icrael ducu ni, “Wuling mot, wuwiny, wun jo Icrael. Inino ma tin aye wudoko iye lwak pa Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Piman dong wuwor dog Rwot Lubangawu kun wumako cik mere ki gin ma en ociko ducu ma acikowu kwede tin.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Acena mabino pi kwero gwoko Cik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Moses ociko lwak inino meno kikome kun waco ni, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:29">Nwo 11:29</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 8:33-35">Yoc 8:33-35</ref></char></note>“Ka dong wutyeko kato loka Jordan, jo magi gibicung iwi got Gerijim ka kilamo gum ikom lwak: jo pa Cimeon, Levi, Juda, Icakar, Yucepu ki Benjamin. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Jo pa Reuben, Gad, Acer, Jabulon, Dan ki Naputali, gibicung iwi got Ebal kama gibiwinyo iye lok me acena ma bipoto ikom dano pi kwero gwoko Cik. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Ci Lulevi gibiwaco lok man bot jo Icrael ducu ki dwon malongo ni:<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:4">Nia 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:17">34:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:4">Lev 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:1">26:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:15-18">Nwo 4:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:8">5:8</ref></char>
    </note> Cen opot ikom dano ma tiyo cal jok apaya mo nyo cal jok nyonyo ma kiliyo aliya matye gin me kwer bot Rwot, ma ladiro tiyo ki cinge ci cibo me awora i mung.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:15">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:12">Nia 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nwo 5:16</ref></char>
    </note> Cen opot ikom dano ma pe woro wone ki mine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:16">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 19:14">Nwo 19:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Cen opot ikom dano ma kobo got ma poko wang lobo pa lawote woko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:17">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:14">Lev 19:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Cen opot ikom dano ma pango wi lawange oto miyo weko yoo ma atir woko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:18">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:21">Nia 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:9">23:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:33-34">Lev 19:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:17-18">Nwo 24:17-18</ref></char>
    </note> Cen opot ikom dano ma balo te pido pa labedo, nyo pa latin kic, nyo pa dato weko lok loye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:19">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:8">Lev 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:11">20:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:30">Nwo 22:30</ref></char>
    </note> Cen opot ikom dano ma butu ki ciwone, pien keto lewic ikom wone.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:20">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:19">Nia 22:19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:23">Lev 18:23</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:15">20:15</ref></char>
    </note> Cen opot ikom dano ma butu ki lee mo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:21">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:9">Lev 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:17">20:17</ref></char>
    </note> Cen opot ikom dano ma butu ki lamine, kadi nya pa wone, kadi nya pa mine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:22">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:17">Lev 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:14">20:14</ref></char>
    </note> Cen opot ikom dano ma butu ki marone.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:23">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />Cen opot ikom dano ma neko lawote alii i mung.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:24">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />Cen opot ikom dano ma ki wilo ki lim pi neko dano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:25">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 3:10">Gal 3:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Cen opot ikom dano ma pe mako lok ducu me cik man dok pe bene lubugi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:26">Ci lwak ducu gibigamo ni, ‘Amen!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s1">Gum mabino pi gwoko cik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Lev 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Nwo 7:12-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 11:13-17">Nwo 11:13-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Moses owaco bot lwak pa jo Icrael ni, “Ka wubiworo dog Rwot Lubangawu, ma wugwoke kun wulubu cike ducu ma acikowu kwede tin, ci Rwot Lubangawu bipilo wiwu makato rok ducu ma wi loboni. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Kace wuworo dog Rwot Lubangawu, ci en bimiyo gum man ducu bibedo mewu matwal:<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />Wubibedo ki gum i taunwu madito ducu dok wubibedo ki gum i potiwu.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />Gum bibedo ikom lutino ma wubinywalogi, ki ikom cam ma bicek i potiwu; ikom lutino dyangiwu ki ikom lutino romiwu ki dyegiwu.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />Ci Lubanga bimiyo camwu bicek mapol dok wubibedo ki ginacama ma oromo.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Wubibedo ki gum i kwowu, dok bene wubilimo gum i tic ducu ma wutiyo.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />Rwot bimiyo wuloyo lumerokwu ducu ma bibino kalweny ikomwu, miyo wubinekogi woko ki inyimwu. Gibimol kalweny ikomwu ki i yoo acel, ento gibiringowu ci gibiket woko ki inyimwu i yoo abiro mapatpat.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu gum ci cam bibedo ma opongo derowu ducu, ki ikom gin ducu ma wubitiyo; bimiyowu gum i lobo ma en bimiyo botwuni.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />Rwot bimokowu me bedo lwake maleng kit mayam okwongo kwede botwu, kace wumako cik pa Rwot Lubangawu, kun wulubu yone ducu. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Jo ma iwi lobo ducu gibineno ka kilwongowu ki nying Rwot, ci gibilworowu. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Rwot bimiyo wulony ki lwak jami mapol; bimiyo wunywalo lutino mapol bimiyo limwu makwo nya madwong ma potiwu bene ceko cam mabup. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Rwot biyabo polo pirwu, ma en ot kano lime maber, ci miyo kot cwer i lobowu i karene, ci miyo gum ikom tic ducu ma wutiyo. Jo me rok mapol gibimako banya botwu ento wun pe wubimako banya mo. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Rwot bimiyo wubedo jo ma telo nyim, pe jo ma coko ter; wubibedo kacito anyim ma pe dong wudok cen, teke wubedo kalubu cik pa Rwot Lubangawu ma acikowu kwede tin kun wugwoke ka cobogi maber. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Ento wunen ni wugwoke ma pe wuloke me kwero lubu lok ducu ma acikowu kwede tin pi woro lubanga mukene ki pi tic pirgi.”<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma bino pi bedo ludingo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Lev 26:14-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />“Kace pe wuworo dog Rwot Lubangawu nyo pe wugwoke kalubu lok ma en ociko ducu ki cike ma acikowu kwede tini, ci lwak cen magi ducu bipoto ikomwu ci moko ikomwu:<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Ci Rwot bimiyo cen bedo ikomwu ki i taunwu ducu wa i potiwu.<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Rwot bene bimiyo cen bibedo ikom camwu ducu ma i potiwu wa ikom otakowu me tedowu ducu.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Cen bibedo ikom lutino ma wubinywalogi, ki ikom cam ma bicek i potiwu, ikom lutino dyangiwu ki ikom lutino romiwu ki dyegiwu.<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Cen bibedo ikomwu ka wudonyo i ot, ci cen bibedo ikomwu ka wukato woko.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />Kace wubwoto Rwot, ma wubedo katiyo gin marac, ci Rwot bicwalo cen ikomwu ma bibangowu woko ci bijukuwu i gin ducu ma wutemo tiyone nio ka wuto wutum woko oyotoyot. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Rwot bimiyo two gemo marac poto ikomwu nio ka bityekowu woko ki i lobo ma wubicito iye ka camone. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Rwot bipwodowu ki two mamato kom dano woko, two aburu, two akwota, ki lyeto madwong; dok bene bicwalo yamo mager labongo kot i lobowu, ci miyo camwu ma i poto bware dok two woko. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Kot pe bicwer i lobowu, ki ngomwu bene bibedo ma otwo woko matek likang macalo nyonyo. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Rwot bicwalo lapiro apulu ki apwa matego ma ka kot i lobowu kun a ki malo duny ikomwu nio ka otyekowu woko.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />Rwot bimiyo lumerokwu giloyowu woko. Wubilubu yo acel ka wucito kalweny ikomgi, ento wubiket woko ata kun wuringo woko ki inyimgi i yoo abiro mapatpat. Lworo bimako ker ducu ma wi lobo pi gin ma bitime ikomwu. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Komwu ma otoni bibedo cam pa winyo ducu me polo, ki pa lee timgu; dok bene dano mo bibedo peke ma ryemogi. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Rwot bipwodowu ki odeke kit mayam otimo ikom jo Ejipt, ki bur adola ki nyac ki gwenyo, ma cangone biloyowu woko. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Rwot bipwodowu ki two apoya ki to wangwu, dok bene bibango tamwu woko. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Wubipange apanga ata i dyeceng macalo lawange oto pange i colpiny, pe wubilimo gum mo i gin ducu ma wubitiyo. Kibibedo ka unuwu kun kiyako jamiwu jwijwi, dok lakonywu bene bibedo peke.<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />Ibitongo keny ikom nyako, ento ngat mukene aye bibutu kwede. Ibigero ot ento pe i bibedo iye. Ibipito poto olok ento pe ibicamo nyige. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Kibineko twonini inyimi ma ineno ento pe ibibilo ringone kadi ki acel. Kibimayo kanani ci kibiterogi woko ki tek ki inyimi, dok bene pe kibidwokone boti. Kibimiyo romini bot lumeroki, dok bene ngat mo ma bikonyi bibedo peke. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Kibimiyo awobeni ki anyirani me bedo opii bot jo me rok mukene i wangi kit man ento pe i bibedo ki twero me gengogi wot. Ibibedo kakuru nino me dwogogi cen kwe ci piny biloyi woko. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Rok mo mayam pe ingeyo aye bicamo cam ma ocek i potoni ducu ma iyele iye ki tic matek dok bene gibiuni ki kit auna madwong malit. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Can ma ibikato ki iye bimiyo ibibange woko pi gin ma ibineno ki wangi. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Rwot bipwodi ki odeke ma odet i congi ki i tyeni ma pe cang; odeke bimwono komi woko liweng kun cake ki i wii nio wa i tyeni.<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />Rwot biterowu kacel ki rwotwu ma wuketo me loyowu i rok mukene mayam peya wungeyo kadi wa kwariwu bene peya gungeyo; wubiworo lwak lubanga mukene kunu ma kipayo calgi ki bao nyo ki got. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Wubidoko gin makelo lworo ikin rok ducu kama Rwot biterowu iye, ci kibitic ki nyingwu macalo ginanywara ki me lok abola.<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Ibipito lwak kodi madwong i potoni, ento ibikayo cam manok keken, pien bonyo bicamo potoni woko. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Ibipito poti olok, ibiyubugi maber, ento pe ibimato kongo bwinone, dok pe ibicoko nyige, pien kwidi bicamogi woko ducu. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Yadi jeituni bidongo kaducu i dye loboni, ento pe ibinongo moo kadi ki acel, pien nyig olok ducu bio woko piny. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Ibinywalo awobe ki anyira, ento pe gibibedo joni, pien kibiterogi woko i opii. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Yadini ducu ki cam ma i potoni ducu bonyo bicamone woko. <verse eid="DEU 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Lubedo ma gibedo ikinwu gibidoko wegi twero dok rwomgi biyito malo maloyowu, ento wun wubimede ameda ki rwenyo twerowu wa rwomwu ducu. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Gin aye dok bimiyo wumako banya botgi, wun pe wubimiyo gimako banya ki botwu. Gin aye gibibedo jo ma telo nyim, wun wubicoko ter.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Lwak atwom magi ducu bipoto ikomwu dok bibedo kwedwu nio ka bityekowu woko, pien wukwero winyo dog Rwot Lubangawu, dok bene pe wulubu cike ki gin mayam ocikowu kwede ducu. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Can magi bibedo lanyut ikomwu kacel ki ikom likwayowu matwal pi kop ma Lubanga ongolo ikomwu. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Yam Rwot Lubanga omiyowu lwak gum ento wun pe wutiyo bote ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Pieno wun dong wubitic pi lumerokwu ma Rwot bicwalo kalweny ikomwu. Kec ki orwo pii binekowu, wubibedo munero ma can jami ducu omakowu, ci Rwot biriyo okol i ngutwu nio ka otyekowu woko ducu. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />Rwot bikelo rok mo ma gua ki kamabor ikomwu kamonyowu, ma pe wuniang lebgi, ci gin bipoto ikomwu macalo ocur ma tuk. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Gin rok ma ger ma pe biparo pi jo ma otii, kadi wa pi timo kica ikom jo matino. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Gibitero leewu woko ducu liweng, ki cam ducu ma ocek i potiwu nio ka kec bityekowu woko liweng. Gin pe biweko ngano mo, kongo bwino mo, ki moo jeituni mo. Dok dyangi, romi ki dyegiwu mo pe bidong botwu; piman wun wubito woko liweng. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Lumerokwu bimonyo taunwu ducu ma oromo dye lobowu ma Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu nio ka cel maboco ki gogo ma wugenoni bigwokowu ducu bipoto woko piny ki i lobowu.<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Ikare ma lumerokwu birumu taunwu woko, kec ki can madit bipoto ikomwu miyo wubicamo ringo kom lutinowu; ringo kom awobewu ki anyirawu ma Rwot Lubangawu omiyo botwu. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54-55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54-55" />Ikare ma lumerok bimonyo taunwu ducu, kadi wa co mayam kinywalogi i gang lonyo ma gudongo ki kuc, kec bicido wanggi woko miyo gibicamo lutinogi pien gin mo mudong botgi me acamo mapat dong pe tye. Dok bene gibitwono omegigi woko, ki mon gi ma gimaro, ki lutinogi mogo ma pud gudong; pe gibiye ni ngat mo ikin gi onywak camo kwedgi, en ringo kom lutinogi ma gitye kacamoneni. <verse eid="DEU 28:54-55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:28-29">2 Luk 6:28-29</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:10">Kok 4:10</ref></char></note> Mon mayam kinywalogi i gang lonyo ma gudongo ki kuc, mayam gilworo wot ki tyen gi nono i ngom pien yam gigwoke mada bene gibitimo lakit tic acelu. Kec bicido wanggi woko ikare ma lumerok bimonyo taunwu ducu, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />miyo gibicamo byero me nywalgi imung ki ringo kom lutino ma gunywalo, dok bene gibitwono coggi wa ki awobegi ki anyiragi ma gimaro.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />Ka pe wugwoke kun wulubu lok ducu ma i cik man ma kicoyo i buk man wek wubed kalworo nying me deyo ki mapek pa Rwot Lubangawu, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />ci Rwot dok bikelo atwom madit ikomwu ki ikom likwayowu, en atwom malik ma bedo nakanaka, ki two magwa ma pe juke. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />En bikelo ikomwu kit two ducu pa jo Ejipt mayam wubedo kalworogi; twone biniang ikomwu matek dok pe bicang. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Dok kit two ducu ki kit atwom ducu ma pe kicoyogi i buk man me cik Rwot aye bikelogi ikomwu, nio ka otyekowu woko liweng. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Kadi onongo yam wunya mapol macalo lwak lakalatwe me polo, kibiweko welwu dong manok mo, pien pe wubedo ka woro dog Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Kit mayam cwiny Rwot obedo yom ikomwu omiyo otimowu maber dok omiyo wunya mapol, kitmeno bene cwiny Rwot dok bibedo yom pi kelowu to piny ma bityekowu woko liweng; ci bikwanyowu woko ki i lobo ma dong wucok donyo iye kacamone.<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />Rwot bikeyowu woko ata ikin rok ducu, cake i agiki lobo tung cel o kwede i agikine mukene tung cel. Wubiworo lwak lubanga mukene kunu ma kipayo calgi ki bao nyo ki got, mayam pe wungeyo kadi wa kwariwu bene pe gungeyo. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Ikin lurok magi pe wubinongo iye kuc mo, dok pe wubinongo iye kayweyo tyenwu, ento Rwot bimiyo cwinywu myel kunu, wangwu bimyeno, tipu komwu bito woko lirut. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Cwinywu bingabe angaba pi kwowu me anyim; wubibedo ki lworo madwong dyewor ki dyeceng, ma pe wutye ki gen mo i kwowu. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Odiko wubiwaco ni, ‘Kono nene obedo otyeno!’ dok otyeno wubiwaco ni, ‘Kono nene obedo odiko!’ pi lworo madwong i cwinywu pi gin matye anyim ma wangwu bineno. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Dok Rwot bidwokowu cen i Ejipt kun kiterowu i mel, wubidok i wot mayam aciko ni pe dok wubinwoyoneni. Wubimine kekenwu kunu bot lumerokwu kun wucate ni kiwilwu wubed opiigi ki angecagi, ento dano mo pe ma biwilowu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s1">Gicike pa Rwot ki jo Icrael i lobo Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Man aye lok me gicike mayam Rwot ociko ki Moses ma oketo ikin gi ki jo Icrael i lobo Moab, ma omedo ikom gicike mayam oketo ikin gi iwi got Koreb.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Moses olwongo jo Icrael ducu ci owaco botgi ni, “Dong wutyeko neno gin ducu mayam Rwot otiyo i lobo Ejipt ki wangwu, gin ma en otimo ikom Parao ki ikom lutice ki i lobone ducu. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Wun yam wuneno ki wangwu gemo mayam Rwot ocwalo ki lanyut ki tango madito ma en otiyo. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Ento nio wa onyo Rwot peya omiyowu cwiny me niang gin ma wangwu oneno nyo ma itwu owinyo. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Rwot dong omiyo atelo wiwu i dye tim mwaka pyere angwen ma bongowu pe otii ki ikomwu, dok war tyenwu bene pe gutii woko ki i tyenwu. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Ikare meno amiyowu gin acama mapat ki mugati ma onongo yam wungeyo con, dok pe wumato kongo bwino nyo kongo makece mayam wungeyo con; wek wunge ni en aye Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="DEU 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Wel 21:21-35</ref></char></note>Ka dong wuo i kabedoni, ci Cikon rwot me Kecbon ki Og rwot me Bacan gubino karomo kwedwa i lweny, ento waloyogi woko, <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Wel 32:33</ref></char></note>ci wamayo lobogi woko wamiyo odoko ginaleya pa jo pa Reuben, ki pa jo pa Gad, ki pa nucu kaka pa Manace. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Pimeno omyero wugwoke kalubu lok ducu me gicike man, wek wulim gum ikom gin ducu ma wutiyo.<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />Tin wun ducu wucung inyim Rwot Lubangawu, ludito wi kakawu, ludongowu, ludito ticwu ki co ducu pa jo Icrael, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />mon mewu kacel ki lutinowu ki lubedo ma gibedo i gonywu ma gin aye lubar yenwu ki lutwom piiwu. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Wucung kany wek wun ducu wukwonge pi donyo i gicike man ma Rwot Lubangawu oketo ikinwu ki en tin, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />wek en omii wubed jone tin, wek en obed Lubangawu, kit mayam ocike kwede botwuni, ki kit mayam okwongo bot kwariwu Abraim, Icaka ki Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Pe aketo kwong man ki gicike man kwedwu keken, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />ento gicike man tye pi wan ma watye kany ki pi likwayowa ducu ma peya kinywalogi.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />Wun wungeyo kit mayam wabedo kwede i lobo Ejipt, kit ma wawoto wabino kwede kun wawok ki i dye rok mapol; <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />dok wuneno gin me kwer ma gitye kwede ducu, cal lubangagi me bao ki me got, me ryal ki me jabu. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:15">Ibru 12:15</ref></char></note> Omyero wunen ni pe tye laco mo, nyo dako mo, nyo dogolawu mo, nyo kakawu mo ma ikinwu ma biloke woko ki ikom Rwot Lubangawa, me cito ka woro lubanga mogo pa rok magi ducu. Ngat ma bingak woko ki ikinwu bibedo rom ki lwit yat matye ki kwir ma nyako nyige makec. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Omyero wunen ni, pe tye ngat mo ikinwu kany matye kawinyo kwong ki gicike magi ducu ento bwole woko kene ni, ‘Gin mo marac ma bipoto ikoma bibedo peke kadi bed angak woko kun amede kitimo gin moni ma kikweroni.’ Kitmeno miyo kibijwero jo mabeco ki jo maracu woko ducu kacel. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Rwot pe bitimo dano macalo meno kica, ento kiniga pa Rwot ki nyekone aye biduny macalo yito ikome, ki lok me ceno dano ma kicoyo i buk man bimoko ikome matwal, nio ka Rwot bijwayo nyinge woko ki ite polo. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />Rwot biketo en macalo labol ikin kaka pa jo Icrael ducu, ci bibolo can mapek ikome ma rwate ki lok ducu me ceno dano matye i gicike ma kicoyo i buk man me cik.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Ci likwayowu ma gibilubowu, lutinowu ma gibileyo katyenwu, ki lurok ma gua ki i lobo mabor, gibineno lwak atwom ducu ma opoto i lobowu ki lwak can ma Rwot omiyo opoto i lobowu. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-25">Aca 19:24-25</ref></char></note>Dok lobowu ducu bidoko aroo, ma opong ki gweng calfa ma mac olenyo, ki kado keken; kodi mo pe kibicoyo iye, gin mo pe dongo iye, wa lum ma lot bene bibedo peke iye. Lobo ma obale woko marom ki Codom ki Gomora ki Adma ki Jeboim, mayam Rwot obalo woko ki kiniga ki akecane. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Ada, lobo ducu bineno man ci gibipenyo ni, ‘Pingo Rwot otimo loboni kit man? Lyeto me kinigane madwong marom man te loke ango?’ <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Ci gibigamo ni, ‘Rwot otimo kitmeno pien jo pa Rwot guweko lubu gicike pa Rwot Lubanga pa kwarigi woko, mayam ocike kwedgi ikare ma okwanyogi ki i Ejipt. <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />Ma ka woro Rwot, gin gucito ka woro lwak lubanga mukene mayam pe gingeyo ki ryebe piny inyimgi, lwak lubanga mayam kikwero ni pe ki worgi. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Ma omiyo kiniga omako Rwot ikom lobo man, ma okelo iye lwak lok ducu me ceno dano ma kicoyo i buk man. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Rwot oputu lwitgi woko ki i lobogi pi kinigane ki akecane ki akemone madwong, ka obayogi woko wa i lobo mukene, kama gitye iye wa onyo.’”<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />Moses dok omede kun waco ni, “Tye mung mogo ma Rwot Lubangawa pe oyabo botwa, meno obedo mung ma mere; ento gin ma dong en oyabo omiyo botwa dong obedo mewa ki pa likwayowa matwal, wek walub lok ducu ma i cik man.”<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael bidok cen bot Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Moses owaco bot jo Icrael ni, “Dong atyeko keto inyimwu gum ma a ki i woro dog Rwot ki acena ma jemo ikom Rwot kelo. Ento ka wubiyero jemo ikom Rwot, ka gin magi ducu dong bipoto ikomwu, ci wubipo pire ki ikin rok ducu kama Rwot Lubangawu bikeyowu iyeni. <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />Kace wudwogo cen bot Rwot Lubangawu, wun ki likwayowu, ci wucako woro doge ilok ducu ma acikowu kwede tin ki cwinywu ducu ki tipuwu ducu, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />ci Rwot Lubangawu bidwoko gum mewu botwu; en dok bicokowu woko ki ikin rok ducu kama yam okeyowu iyeni. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Kadi wa jowu ma obayogi kamabor wa i agiki te polo, Rwot Lubangawu bicokogi woko ki kunu; ci biomowu woko ki kunu. <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />Rwot Lubangawu bikelowu i lobo mayam kwariwu gucamoni wek wun bene wucam obed mewu. Lubanga bimiyo wubedo ki lwak lonyo mabeco, kun wunya mapol makato kwariwu. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Rwot Lubangawu bimiyo wubedo jo ma cwinygi ber dok winyo lok, wun ki likwayowu bene, wek wumar Rwot Lubangawu ki cwinywu ducu ki tipuwu ducu wek wubed makwo. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Rwot Lubangawu biketo acena magi ducu ikom lumonewu ki ikom lumerokwu ma guunuwu, <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />ci wun dok wubiworo dog Rwot kun wugwoko cike ducu ma acikowu kwede tin. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Rwot Lubangawu bimiyo wubedo ki jami mabeco madwong mada ma wubinongo pi ticwu; wubibedo ki lutino mapol, limwu makwo binya mapol bene, potiwu biceko cam mabup, pien cwiny Rwot dok bibedo yom pi miyowu lonyo ki jami mabeco, kit mayam cwinye obedo yom ikom kwariwuni. <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />Kace wubiworo dog Rwot Lubangawu, ma wugwoko cike ki gin ma ociko ducu ma kicoyo i buk man me cik, kace wudwogo cen bot Rwot Lubangawu ki cwinywu ducu ki tipuwu ducu, ci Lubanga bimiyowu gum man.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />Pien cik ma acikowu kwede tin pe tek tutwal ma cobone loyowu, dok niang iye pe tek tutwal. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:6-8">Rom 10:6-8</ref></char></note>Pe tye wa i polo, ma kono omiyo wuwac ni, ‘Anga ma bicito ka omone wa ki malo i polo kuca, wek okel botwa ka wek wawiny loke ci walubi?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Dok pe tye wa loka nam, ma kono omiyo wuwac ni, ‘Anga ma bicito pirwa wa loka nam kuca, wek okel botwa ka wek wawiny loke ci walubi?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Ento loke tye cok kwedwu; wumako dong i cwinywu, ci wubedo ka tucune ki dogwu, miyo wutwero lubune.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />Wunen maber ni, tin atyeko keto inyimwu kwo ki lonyo, to ki keckom. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Kace wuworo cik pa Rwot Lubangawu ma ocikowu kwede tin, wek wumar Rwot Lubangawu, kun wulubu yone dok wugwoko cike ki gin ma en ociko nyo ongolo ducu, ci wubikwo dok wubinya mapol, dok Rwot Lubangawu bimiyowu gum i lobo ma wubidonyo iye kacamoneni. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Ento kace cwinywu odok cen karyebe inyim lubanga mukene ki tiyo botgi ma wukwero winyo dog Rwot, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />ci nen, tin aloko atir botwu ni wubito wutum woko; pe wubirii pi kare malac i lobo ma wubicito iye loka Jordan kacamoneni. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Alwongo polo ki lobo me bedo lucaden ikomwu tin, dong atyeko keto inyimwu kwo ki to, gum ki acena; ma omiyo wuyer kwo wek wun ki likwayowu wubed makwo. <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Aca 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28:13</ref></char></note> Wumar Rwot Lubangawu, wuwor doge ci wumok ikome matek; en aye kelo kwo botwu, ci miyo wurii pi kare malac, wek wubed i lobo mayam Rwot okwongo pire bot kwariwu Abraim, Icaka ki Yakobo ni ebimiyogi.”<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yocwa oleyo katyen Moses</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 27:12-23">Wel 27:12-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Moses dok omede ki waco lok magi bot jo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:12">Wel 20:12</ref></char></note>Owaco botgi ni, “An mwaka me dita dong romo miya ki pyere aryo tin, ci pe dong aromo wot ki dwogo kit ma iya mito. Rwot otyeko waco bota ni pe abikato loka Jordan. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Rwot Lubangawu kikome aye dong bitelo nyimwu wa loka ca. En bityeko rok magi woko ducu ki inyimwu, ci wubicamo lobogi; ki Yocwa aye dong bikato loka ca katelo wiwu kit ma dong Rwot owaconi. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Wel 21:21-35</ref></char></note>Rwot bitimogi kit mayam otimo ikom Cikon ki Og ma luker pa jo Amor ki ikom lobogi ikare ma otyekogi kwede wokoni. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Rwot bimiyo gipoto i cingwu, wun wubitimogi ma lubu cik ducu ma atyeko cikowu kwedeni. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Wubed oteka ma cwinywu nwang; pe wulwor, pe atiba opot ikomwu pirgi, pien Rwot Lubangawu aye biwot kwedwu, pe bibwotowu ata, pe biwekowu wudong kenwu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Lacen Moses olwongo Yocwa ci owaco bote ki inyim jo Icrael ducu ni, “Bed oteka ma cwinyi nwang, pien ibicito ki lwak man wa i lobo mayam Rwot okwongo pire bot kwarigi ni ebimiyogi, dok in aye ibimiyo gicamo doko meggi. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:5">Yoc 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:5">Ibru 13:5</ref></char></note>Rwot aye bitelo nyimi, en bibedo kwedi, pe bibwoti ata, pe biweki keni. Pe ilwor, cwinyi pe opoti.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik myero kikwan inge mwaka abiroabiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Moses ocoyo cik man ducu ci omiyo bot ajwaki ma gin likwayo pa Levi, mayam gitingo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot, ki bot ludongo ducu pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:1">Nwo 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13-15">16:13-15</ref></char></note> En ocikogi ni, “Inge mwaka abiroabiro ducu, ikare ma kiciko pireni obed mwaka me weko banya, wubikwano iye cik man inino me Karama me Bolo. <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />Wubilwongo jo Icrael ducu me bino inyim Rwot Lubangagi i kabedo ma en biyerone, ci wubikwano iye cik man inyim jo Icrael ducu wek guwiny. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Wugur lwak kacel, co wa ki mon ki lutino, ki lubedo ma gibedo i taunwu, wek guwiny ci gupwony lworo Rwot Lubangawu, wek gugwoke kun gilubu lok ducu me cik man. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Kitmeno, lutinogi ma peya gungeyo loke gibiwinyo ci gibipwonyo lworo Rwot Lubangawu ikare ducu ma wubedo i lobo ma wucito iye loka Jordan kacamo.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik pa Rwot me agiki bot Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Dok Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, “Nen, nino ma ibito iye dong onyiko cok. Lwong Yocwa ci wucung kwede i Kema me Rwate wek acike.” Ci Moses ki Yocwa gucito gucung i Kema me Rwate, <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />ci Rwot onen i Kema ki wir me pol; ci wir me pol ocung okemo dogola me Kema.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Nen, in dong icok to woko, ci lwak man gibitware gibicito ka woro lubanga mogo ma welo kun gidoko jo ma pe gigene i lobo ma gicito kabedo iye. Gibibwota woko dok gibituru gicikena ma atyeko ketone ikinwa wan kwedgi. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Dok kiniga bimaka ikomgi ikare meno, ci abitenyogi woko dok abikwero konyogi woko, miyo kibityekogi woko liweng. Gin maracu ki lwak ayela mapol bipoto ikomgi, mamiyo ikare meno gibiwaco ni, ‘Gin ma omiyo can man opoto ikomwa, pien Lubangawa dong pe tye ikinwa.’ <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Abikwero konyogi woko ikare meno adada pi lwak balgi ducu ma gubedo katimo, pien gudok woko cen bot lwak lubanga mukene. <verse eid="DEU 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />Kombedi dong i coo wer man. Pwony ki jo Icrael wek obed caden ma mera ikomgi. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Pien ka akelogi i lobo ma miu maceko cam mapol mayam akwongo pire ni abimiyo bot kwarigi, ka gucamo ci guyeng gucwe kwede, ci gibidok cen bot lubanga mogo mukene. Gibiworogi ma kun gicaya woko, dok gituru gicikena. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Dok ka gin maracu mapol ki lwak ayela mapol opoto ikomgi, ci wer man bicung inyimgi me bedo caden botgi, pien likwayogi pud gibiwero, wigi pe biwil iye. Pien angeyo tam ma gutyeko yubune ma onongo peya aterogi i lobo mayam akwongo pire ni abimiyogi.” <verse eid="DEU 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Moses ocoyo wer meno inino meno kikome, ci opwonyo ki jo Icrael.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 27:23">Wel 27:23</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:6">Yoc 1:6</ref></char>
    </note>Ka Rwot ociko Yocwa wod pa Nun kun waco bote ni, “Bed oteka ma cwinyi nwang, pien in aye ibitero likwayo pa Icrael i lobo mayam akwongo pire ni abimiyo botgi, ci an abibedo kwedi.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Ka yam Moses otyeko coyo lok me Cik man ducu i buk nio ka otum woko ducu, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />ci ociko Lulevi ma gitingo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />ni, “Wugam buk man me cik, wuket inget Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot Lubangawu, wek obed kunu me bedo caden ikomwu. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Pien angeyo kit jemowu ki kit ma ngutwu nwang kwede ducu. Nen, gin gubedo kajemo ikom Rwot ma an pud atye kwedwu ma akwo, ci jemowu bibedo dwong marom mene ka dong ato woko? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Wumii ludongo ma i kakawu ducu ki ludito ticwu gugure kacel ka dong guwiny lok magi, kun alwongo polo ki lobo wek obed caden ikomgi. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Pien angeyo adada ni, ka dong ato, ci wubitimo tim aranyi; wun wubiloke dok wubibare woko ki i yo ma acikowu kwede. Gin marac bipoto ikomwu ikare me anyim, pien wubitimo gin manen marac iwang Rwot kun wumiyo kiniga make pi gin ma wutiyo.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wer pa Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Ci Moses okwano lok ma i wer man nio ka otyeko ducu, kun lwak jo Icrael ducu ma gugure kacel gubedo kawinyone.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />“Wucik itwu, wun jo matye i polo ki lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:1">wek wuwiny lok ma an dong abiloko maber.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Pwony ma mera bicwer macalo kot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">dok biton i lobo macalo toyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">Macalo kot ma ngido ikom lum alita</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">macalo kot ma wo ikom ginapita ma pud otwi nyen.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Pien abipako nying Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:3">ci an abitito pi dit pa Lubangawa!<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />Rwot aye Got ma gwokowa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">tice ducu cobe kakare dok gin ducu ma en tiyo tye atir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">En Lubanga ma lagen, dok tye ki ada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">kite atir, gin ma en timo ducu tye maber.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Ento wun lutim tim aranyi ikome;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:5">jo ma pe gene dok bene pe gupore me bedo lutinone, pien komgi kimwonyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:5">gin aye yalwak ma ongak ma ogom woko.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Man aye kit ma wuculu ki Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">wun jo maming ki rok ma pe ki ryeko?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Pe en aye wonwu ma ocweyowu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Pe en aye lacwec ma omiyo wudoko rok madit?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Po ikom kare mayam con ca,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">tam pi lwak mwaka pa yalwak macon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Peny woru, ci binyuti maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">ki ludongowu bene gibitito botwu gin mayam otime con.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:26">Tic 17:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare ma En Mamalo Twal yam omiyo ki rok ducu ginaleyagi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">ikare ma opoko kin lutino pa dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">yam opoko wang lobo pa rok acel acel</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">kun lubu wel awobe pa Icrael.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Pien lwak pa Rwot gin aye dulle,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:9">jo pa Yakobo aye gipiny ma kipoko bote.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />Yam en onongo Yakobo i dye tim aroo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">i lobo kweyo marac ma dano pe iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">okwake ki bade kun gwoke maber macalo tong wange kikome.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Macalo ocur ma pwonyo lutinone ki tuk</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">kun tengo bwome ma oyaro ka wigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">yaro bwome ka jologi kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">ci tingogi ki kono lacar madito.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Rwot kene aye yam telo wi jone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:12">kun onongo lubanga pa lurok mo pe ma okonye.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Omiyo guringo iwi cere ma otinge malo i lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">opitogi ki cam ma ocek i poto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">omiyogi doto moo kic ma nonge iwi got,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">ki noto moo jeituni ma ocek i dye pata got matek.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Omiyo guboto cak lukulu pa dyangi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">ki mato cak ma libo bene pa dyegigi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">gucamo moo lutino romi ki nyogi romi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">ki ringo dyangi me Bacan ki ringo dyegi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">kacel ki moko ngano mabecone tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">gumato kongo bwino makwar me pig olok.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Ento Jecurun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:15 </char><char style="fk">Jecurun </char> te loke ni ngat ma kite atir. </note> odoko lalonyo, ci odoko lajemo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">jo pa Rwot gucwe ma komgi pek, ma olinge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Gubwoto Lubanga ma Lacwecgi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">gucayo Got ma olarogini woko.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Guworo lubanga pa rok mukene ma omiyo nyeko omake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:16">gungeto cwinye ki tim marac me kwer</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:16">omiyo kiniga omake.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:20">1 Kor 10:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gutumu tum bot jogi ento pe bot Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:17">bot lubanga mogo mayam kwarigi pe gungeyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:17">bot lubanga mogo manyen ma obino lacen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:17">mayam kwarigi pe guworo.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Gin pe guparo Got ma ocweyogini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:18">wigi owil woko ikom Lubanga ma Wongini.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />Rwot oneno ci ongeto cwinye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:19">ci omiyo en okwero awobene ki anyirane woko.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />En owaco ni, ‘Pe dong abikonyogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">wek dong anen kit ma gibitum kwede;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">pien gin yalwak ma gungak woko ata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">gin lutino ma pe lugen.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:22">1 Kor 10:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:19">Rom 10:19</ref></char>
    </note>Gin gumiyo akemo omaka pien guworo gin ata ma pe lubanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">gungeto cwinya ki cal jogi acweyagu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">An bene abimiyo nyeko makogi ikom ji mogo ata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">abimiyo rok mo maming ngeto cwinygi.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Pien kinigana dong omoko mac woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">dong tye ka wang wa ite bur matut me lyel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">kun wango lobo ki gin ma ocek iye ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">ka dok cwinyo mac wango wa te guti me godi.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />Abicoko can aguru i wigi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:23">abityeko aterona woko ikomgi.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Kec aye bimiyo gijony lingok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">dok abiwangogi ki lyeto ki two gemo maracu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">abityekogi woko liweng; abicwalo lak nguu ikomgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">ki kwir pa gin ma lak alaka i ngom.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Ki i dye gudugi pala lucwan bityekogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">ki lworo bene binekogi woko wa i kicika otgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">magi ducu bitime ikom lutino co ki anyira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">ikom lutino ma dot wa ki jo ma wigi ki lwar.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Onongo amito keyogi woko kama boco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:26">wek nyinggi pe dong kipo iye ikin dano.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Ento alworo lumerok wek pe gunget cwinya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">wek lumonegi pe guter marac, wek pe guwac ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">gin aye guloyogi dok cing Rwot pe otimo gin mo.’<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Pien jo Icrael gubedo jo ma wigi pe tiyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:28">niang lok bene loyogi woko.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Ka onongo nene giryek, kono onongo guniang lok man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:29">kono onongo gungeyo agiki me kwogi.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Cake ningning ni dano acel keken aye ryemo jo alip kulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">dok jo aryo twaro jo alip apar kulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">ka pe Lubangagi aye omiyogi woko bot lukworgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">ka pe Rwot aye otenyogi woko?<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Pien lubanga pa lumerokwa pe gitek calo Lubangawa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:31">wa merokwa bene giye lok man.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Lukworwa girom ki jo Codom ki Gomora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">gical ki olok marac ma nyige kec;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">girom ki kongo bwino ma kirubu ki kwir twol,<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />macalo kongo bwino ma kirubu ki kwir twol golla mager.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Man aye gin ma akano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:34">ma agwoko i ot kano lima.<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:19">Rom 12:19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:30">Ibru 10:30</ref></char>
    </note>An aye abiculu kwor, abiculu wange lacen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">Akuru kare ma tyen gi bicer;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">pien nino me to pinygi dong cok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">bipoto ikomgi atura.’<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:36a: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 135:14">Jab 135:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pien Rwot bingolo kop atir pi jone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">kica bimake ikom lutice</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">ka oneno tekgi dong otum woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">ma dano mo pe odong kadi opii nyo ngat ma lone kene.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Ci Rwot bipenyogi ni, ‘Lwak lubanga pa lurok dong gitye kwene ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:37">ki lubanga ma tego mayam wuringo wularo iyeni?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Jogi mayam wupitogi ki moo me gitumwu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">ki ma gumato kongo bwino me gityer amatawu dong gitye kwene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Wek dong gua malo kakonyowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">wek gin aye gubed jo ma gwokowu!<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />Tin dong wunen ni, an aye Lubanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">lubanga mukene ma ada dong peke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">An aye aneko dok an aye amiyo kwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">an aye aketo ret dok acango bure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">dok pe tye ngat mo ma laro dano ki i cinga.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Atingo cinga malo acimo polo ci akwongo kwong man ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:40">Macalo an Lubanga ma abedo kwo matwal,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />kace apako pala lucwana ma mil amila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">madong ayube me miyo pwod,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">ci abiculu kwor ikom lumonena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">abiketo can ikom jo ma gidaga.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Abimiyo aterona mer ki remo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">pala lucwana bicamo ringo mabup,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">biyeng ki remo pa jo ma kinekogi ki ma kimakogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">bitongo wi lutel pa lumerok.’<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:10">Rom 15:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:2">Niy 19:2</ref></char>
    </note>Wupake wun rok ducu kacel ki lwake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">pien en biculu kwor remo pa lutice; en biculu kwor ikom lumonene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">pi kwanyo bal woko ki i lobo pa jone.”<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Moses okwano wer man ducu wek lwak guwiny, en kacel ki Yocwa wod pa Nun.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moses ociko jo Icrael tyen me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Ka Moses otyeko waco lok magi ducu bot jo Icrael ducu ci owaco botgi ni, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />“Wuket i cwinywu lok ducu ma awaco botwu tin, wek wuketgi gubed cik ma mako lutinowu bene, wek gugwoke kalubu lok ducu me cik man. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Lok magi pe lok ma tere pe; gin aye kwowu kikome. Pi gwoko cik magi miyo wubirii pi kare malac i lobo ma wucito iye loka Jordan kacamone.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga onyutu lobo Kanaan bot Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:48: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 27:12-14">Wel 27:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:23-27">Nwo 3:23-27</ref></char>
    </note>Inino meno kikome Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“It malo iwi got man me Abarim, got Nebo, matye i lobo Moab mukemo Jeriko, wek inen lobo Kanaan ma abimiyo bot jo Icrael me bedo meggi. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Ibito iwi got kama i ito iyeni wek idok bot lutuwu, macalo omeru Aron yam oto iwi got Kor ci odok bot lutugi; <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />pien yam wungayo wanga woko ki i dye jo Icrael, i dog pii me Meriba i Kadec i tim me Jin; yam pe wuwora inyim jo Icrael macalo an Lubanga maleng. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Pimeno ibineno lobonu ki cen inyimi kuca, ento pe ibicito kunu, i lobo ma abimiyo ki jo Icrael.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s1">Moses olamo gum ikom kaka pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Man aye lamo gum pa Moses ma dano pa Lubangani, mayam olamo ikom likwayo pa Icrael ma onongo peya oto.<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />En owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">“Rwot yam obino oa ki iwi got Cinai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">ci otuc ki i Ceir wa ikomwa cut, kun ryeny ki iwi got Paran.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Obino ma oa ki ikin jo maleng alip apar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">ki leb mac ma lyel tung cinge ma lacuc.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Ada, Rwot maro jone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">dok gwoko jo ma mere ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Pimeno waryebe katyene kun walubu cike.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Dong amiyo botwu cik man</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:4">me bedo me aleya pa lwak pa Yakobo.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Kitmeno Rwot odoko rwot i Jecurun ikare ma ludito ma gitelo wi lwak gucoke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:5">ma kaka pa jo Icrael ducu gugure kacel.”<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Ikom kaka pa Reuben Moses olamo gum ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:6">“Wek kaka pa Reuben gubed makwo, pe guto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:6">kadi bed jone nok.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Ci olamo gum ikom kaka pa Juda ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">“Ai Rwot, winy dwon jo pa Juda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">dwokgi cen paco bot jo gi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Wek gin gudok tek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">ikonygi kalweny ikom lumonegi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:7">Nia 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 28:30">28:30</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:13">Wel 20:13</ref></char>
    </note>Ikom kaka pa Levi olamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">“Mi ki kaka pa Levi Tumim ki Urim meri, wek guti kwede me ngeyo mit ma meri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Gin aye jo mayam iomo igi i Maca,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">gin aye jo mayam itemogi inget pii me Meriba pien gin lwori.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Jo pa Levi yam gumako loki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">dok gulubu gicikeni bot jo Icrael;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">makato paro pi kwo pa wegigi ki pa megigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">pa omegigi ki pa lumegigi wa ki pa lutinogi bene.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Jo pa Levi bipwonyo jo pa Yakobo ki lok ma ingolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">gibipwonyo ciki bot jo Icrael;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">dok gin aye biwango odok eceta inyimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">gibityero gitum ma kiwango woko ducu ki bere iwi keno tyer ma meri.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Ai Rwot, mii gum ki kaka pa Levi wek gudok tek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">dok ijol ticgi ducu ma gitiyo ki cinggi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Nyon pyer lumonegi piny, ma gin aye jo ma dagi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">wek pe dok gutub ikomgi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Ikom kaka pa Benjamin olamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">“Jo ma Rwot maroni gibedo ki kuc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">Rwot Mamalo Twal gwokogi kare ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">tingogi i gwoke.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Ikom kaka pa Yucepu olamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">“Rwot omii gum opot ikom lobogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">ki mot mabeco ma a ki malo i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">ki ma a ki i kut matut ma oyare ite lobo.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Omii lobogi nyig yadi mabeco ma nyak dok cek ki ceng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:14">ki lonyo me cam ma cek i dwene kikome.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Omii godigi ma rii nakanaka opong ki yadi ma nyako nyiggi mabeco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:15">ki jami mabeco opong iwi ceregi mabedo matwal.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Wek lobogi opong ki cam mabeco keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">ki gum pa Lubanga ma onyute i caka ma olyel mac.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Wek gum magi ducu gupot ikom jo pa Yucepu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">pien en obedo laker ikin omegine.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Teko pa jo pa Yocepu bibedo calo teko pa wod twon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">macalo teko pa tung twon ma i tim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Teko pa Yocepu aye jo makato alip pa Manace ki jo alip apar pa Epraim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Gin bilweny ikom lumerokgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">gibiryemogi woko cen, wa i agiki piny.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Ikom kaka pa Jabulon ki Icakar olamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">“Wek jo pa Jabulon onong gum i biacaragi i nam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">Jo pa Icakar gibinongo lonyogi i gangigi.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Gibilwongo rok ducu wek gucit iwi godigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">gibityero gitum ma opore kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">gibinongo lonyogi ki i nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">kacel ki lonyo matye iwi tera i dog nam.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Ikom kaka pa Gad olamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">“Kipak Lubanga, en aye ma oyabo i lobo pa jo pa Gad malac!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">Jo pa Gad gibutu piny macalo min labwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">en yeco bat lee ka dango wiye.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Ikare ma ludito wi Icrael gucoke kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">gumiyogi lobo pa lawimony, lobo mabere ni obed meggi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Gutimo gin matye atir i nying Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">gucobo gin ma Rwot ociko bot jo Icrael.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Ikom kaka pa Dan olamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">“Jo pa Dan aye calo latin labwor ma kire nia ki i Bacan.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Ikom kaka pa Naputali olamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">“Rwot omiyo gum madwong adada ki kaka pa Naputali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">dok gum pa Rwot bene dwong ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">lobogi bene a ki i dog nam Galilaya cito naka wa tung kupiny.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Ikom kaka pa Acer olamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">“Kaka pa Acer olim gum madit makato kaka pa jo Icrael ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">wek cwiny Lubanga omargi makato omegine ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">wek lobone opong ki yat Jeituni ma nyako nyiggi mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">wek gubed ki moo madwong adada i lobogi.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Laceg dog taun gi obed nyonyo iron ki nyonyo mola;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:25">bed ki tek komi nio wa iwang togi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Pe tye ngat mo macalo Lubangawu, wun jo Jecurun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:26">ma lor piny ki i pol bino kwede kakonyowu, kun baro dye polo ki deyone.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Lubanga ma bedo nakanakani en aye kabedowu me kanewu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">tekone mabedo nakanakani tye ma tingowu kwede malo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">En oryemo lumerok woko ki inyimwu kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">tyekgi woko liweng.<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Kitmeno, jo Icrael yam gubedo ki kuc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">likwayo pa Yakobo gubedo ken gi labongo ayela i lobo ma opong ki ngano ki kongo bwino;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">eyo, polo bene bimiyo kot ma oromo i lobogi.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Cwinyi yom kuman, Icrael!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Anga mono macalo in ka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">In i rok mayam Rwot olaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Rwot aye kwotwu ma gwokowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">ki pala lucwanwu maloyo lumerokwu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Lumerokwu gibibino botwu kun gimwole amwola;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">ento wun wubinyonogi woko piny.<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s1">To pa Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Moses oa ki i lobo aroo me Moab, ocito iwi got Nebo, oito wa iwi lacol me got Piciga ma okemo Jeriko, ci Rwot onyute lobo ducu. Onyute lobo Gilead ducu nio kwede wa i Dan, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />ki lobo Naputali ducu, ki lobo pa jo Epraim ki Manace, ki lobo Juda ducu nio kwede wa tung kupotoceng me Nam Mediterranean, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />ki Negeb kacel ki lobo barbar, ma en aye nota me Jeriko, ma en aye taun madit me yadi otit, nio kwede wa i Joar. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Aca 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28:13</ref></char></note>Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Man aye lobo mayam akwongo pire bot Abraim ki Icaka ki Yakobo, ni abimiyone bot likwayogi. Dong aweko in ineno lobone ki wangi, ento pe ibikato loka ca.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Moses latic pa Rwot oto kitmeno ki i lobo Moab, kit mayam Rwot owaconi. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Ci Rwot oyike kunu i nota ma i lobo Moab ma okemo Bet-peor; ento pe tye dano mo ma ongeyo kabedo ma Rwot oyike iye nio wa onyo. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Moses onongo mwaka me dite romo miya acel ki pyere aryo ka oto. Onongo wange peya ocor, ki kome bene onongo pud tek. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Jo Icrael gukoko Moses ki i lobo aroo me Moab pi nino pyere adek, ci dong kare me koko ki kumu pi Moses otum woko.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Yocwa wod pa Nun yam opong ki cwiny me ryeko, pien onongo yam Moses oketo cinge ikome; ma omiyo jo Icrael gubedo ka woro doge, kun gilubu kit mayam Rwot ociko ki Moses. <verse eid="DEU 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:11">Nia 33:11</ref></char></note>Lanebi mo mukene pe dok onen macalo Moses, mayam Rwot loko kwede wang ki wang. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Pe tye ngat mo marom kwede ma obedo katiyo lwak lanyut ki tango ducu ma Rwot ocwale kwede i lobo Ejipt, ma otiyo ikom Parao ki lutice ducu ki lobone ducu. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Pe tye lanebi mo mukene ma obedo ki twer madwong marom ki mere pi tiyo kit tic madito ki makelo lworo madwong kit mayam Moses obedo katiyone ki inyim jo Icrael ducu.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>